(3721664, 521973, 15711, '<td valign="top">HEE HEE - this would make a cute greeting card. Maybe not as WOW as Free Study requires, but cute. Nice focus and stop action. I like hte water drops.</td>', 'HEE HEE - this would make a cute greeting card. Maybe not as WOW as Free Study requires, but cute. Nice focus and stop action. I like hte water drops.', '2007-06-01 01:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
