(3721684, 525356, 47316, '<td valign="top">You got a lovely cloudy day! Whenever I pass the windmills in my area all I get is LA haze!  This shot might be cool with a larger central subject in the forground... other than that can''t think of any other negatives. Really vibrant image.</td>', 'You got a lovely cloudy day! Whenever I pass the windmills in my area all I get is LA haze!  This shot might be cool with a larger central subject in the forground... other than that can''t think of any other negatives. Really vibrant image.', '2007-06-01 01:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3721685, 520759, 41337, '<td valign="top">I really like this.</td>', 'I really like this.', '2007-06-01 01:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3721688, 524820, 51793, '<td valign="top">I think the colors are missing some zing. It''s a good photo but I just don''t like far away shots, I think it takes the detail out of a subject... But that''s just me.</td>', 'I think the colors are missing some zing. It''s a good photo but I just don''t like far away shots, I think it takes the detail out of a subject... But that''s just me.', '2007-06-01 01:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
