(3721719, 524260, 47316, '<td valign="top">Lighting is fine as well as composition. Overall this image is really lacking purpose. The man''s expression almost looks as he he is not paying much attention. The background should have been darkened on the right side to hide the wrinkles. Overal for an image such as this to work you need a strong expression, or else it just looks as if you are testing a technique with no reason for it.</td>', 'Lighting is fine as well as composition. Overall this image is really lacking purpose. The man''s expression almost looks as he he is not paying much attention. The background should have been darkened on the right side to hide the wrinkles. Overal for an image such as this to work you need a strong expression, or else it just looks as if you are testing a technique with no reason for it.', '2007-06-01 01:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3721724, 524524, 51793, '<td valign="top">IR is pretty and is a very awesome effect but it''s already getting old. Sorry but that''s just how I feel.</td>', 'IR is pretty and is a very awesome effect but it''s already getting old. Sorry but that''s just how I feel.', '2007-06-01 01:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
