(3722102, 511793, 31403, '<td valign="top">those rocks in the foreground are interpreted by my eye as motion blurred when I look at the house.<br/> <br/>The fact that they are brighter makes me think the rocks are your subject since that''s where my eye wants to stay, and the house is a decoration to the main subject.  I''d burn those rocks down and brighten the house to give it more balance - but that''s just me.</td>', 'those rocks in the foreground are interpreted by my eye as motion blurred when I look at the house. The fact that they are brighter makes me think the rocks are your subject since that''s where my eye wants to stay, and the house is a decoration to the main subject.  I''d burn those rocks down and brighten the house to give it more balance - but that''s just me.', '2007-06-01 02:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722103, 524667, 22970, '<td valign="top">A good photograph but I feel unbalanced as I look at it. I know your horizon is straight but it has that feel that everything is going to fall to the right. However you did a great job with light and processing it to black and white.</td>', 'A good photograph but I feel unbalanced as I look at it. I know your horizon is straight but it has that feel that everything is going to fall to the right. However you did a great job with light and processing it to black and white.', '2007-06-01 02:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722105, 510363, 19982, '<td valign="top">Precious!<br/> <br/>I hope the mom orders a big print of this one to cherish for a lifetime!</td>', 'Precious! I hope the mom orders a big print of this one to cherish for a lifetime!', '2007-06-01 02:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722106, 524990, 51793, '<td valign="top">this has some really great yellows. If the bee was in focus it would be 10 times better. Great job though, I don''t blame you for staying a distance.</td>', 'this has some really great yellows. If the bee was in focus it would be 10 times better. Great job though, I don''t blame you for staying a distance.', '2007-06-01 02:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722109, 523681, 38032, '<td valign="top">great classical feel</td>', 'great classical feel', '2007-06-01 02:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722110, 512407, 22970, '<td valign="top">I don''t know for sure if this has been ran through HDR but it looks like it to me. The sky is dramatic along with the rock wall but detail is lost in the dark and harsh saturation on the boats and water. Still an above avg. photograph.</td>', 'I don''t know for sure if this has been ran through HDR but it looks like it to me. The sky is dramatic along with the rock wall but detail is lost in the dark and harsh saturation on the boats and water. Still an above avg. photograph.', '2007-06-01 02:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722111, 519141, 31403, '<td valign="top">great eye for the wonderful detail of everyday life - I''ll bet "they" are skipping right by this.  But to me this is the magic of photography.  You show me something special about the world that I would never think to look at myself.  This is great work - in spite of what "they" might be voting.  I hope I''m wrong and this does very well - it deserves it.</td>', 'great eye for the wonderful detail of everyday life - I''ll bet "they" are skipping right by this.  But to me this is the magic of photography.  You show me something special about the world that I would never think to look at myself.  This is great work - in spite of what "they" might be voting.  I hope I''m wrong and this does very well - it deserves it.', '2007-06-01 02:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722113, 525037, 51793, '<td valign="top">everytime I come back to this page she is staring at me... So let me comment and vote to make her stop (she was on the frist row)...<br/> <br/>Her eyes match perftectly, and her freckles are outstanding. The lighting and DOF are both wonderful and this is a very good shot. Was this shot in a studio???</td>', 'everytime I come back to this page she is staring at me... So let me comment and vote to make her stop (she was on the frist row)... Her eyes match perftectly, and her freckles are outstanding. The lighting and DOF are both wonderful and this is a very good shot. Was this shot in a studio???', '2007-06-01 02:19:21.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3722114, 510363, 66398, '<td valign="top">I opened this and stared so long I had to comment to let you know. This is a beautiful shot and one to treasure forever. I''m giving you a 10 but it probably won''t stay because I doubt I''ll get through 20% but I might. I love the lighting in this, the different textures of Moms earrings, the wall, the blanket, and Mom''s shirt. They''re all different yet very complimentary. And the expression on Mom is just beautiful. Not to mention such a beautiful lady as well. It''s no wonder the baby is so precious.</td>', 'I opened this and stared so long I had to comment to let you know. This is a beautiful shot and one to treasure forever. I''m giving you a 10 but it probably won''t stay because I doubt I''ll get through 20% but I might. I love the lighting in this, the different textures of Moms earrings, the wall, the blanket, and Mom''s shirt. They''re all different yet very complimentary. And the expression on Mom is just beautiful. Not to mention such a beautiful lady as well. It''s no wonder the baby is so precious.', '2007-06-01 02:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722115, 525435, 772, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done :)</td>', 'Very nicely done :)', '2007-06-01 02:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722117, 524379, 31403, '<td valign="top">here''s a hard hitting comment you can learn from  "wow!"  8 for now</td>', 'here''s a hard hitting comment you can learn from  "wow!"  8 for now', '2007-06-01 02:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722118, 520464, 22970, '<td valign="top">Looks like an oil spill in the water behind your subject that is distracting the shot. I really don''t like the tone of the water but the Lily is very nice.</td>', 'Looks like an oil spill in the water behind your subject that is distracting the shot. I really don''t like the tone of the water but the Lily is very nice.', '2007-06-01 02:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722121, 525039, 24974, '<td valign="top">I wish I could un-see that. I am going to wash my brain now.  :-)</td>', 'I wish I could un-see that. I am going to wash my brain now.  :-)', '2007-06-01 02:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722122, 508919, 31403, '<td valign="top">smaller aperture please - not sure what''s in focus, it all feels soft to me (no pun intended)</td>', 'smaller aperture please - not sure what''s in focus, it all feels soft to me (no pun intended)', '2007-06-01 02:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722126, 514178, 65319, '<td valign="top">What a perfect example of a classic landscape.  The cloud pattern which dominates the expansive sky balanced by the desolate rocks and the lonely old wind mill...create a nostalgic sense of the Old West.  I''m just waiting for the stage coach to round the corner with horse galloping full steam down the road.  A perfect 10.</td>', 'What a perfect example of a classic landscape.  The cloud pattern which dominates the expansive sky balanced by the desolate rocks and the lonely old wind mill...create a nostalgic sense of the Old West.  I''m just waiting for the stage coach to round the corner with horse galloping full steam down the road.  A perfect 10.', '2007-06-01 02:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722127, 525213, 51793, '<td valign="top">Ummm someone give this girl some food, Geees this poor thing. <br/> <br/>Great people haters...</td>', 'Ummm someone give this girl some food, Geees this poor thing.  Great people haters...', '2007-06-01 02:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722128, 521570, 31403, '<td valign="top">turn her around and stand her up straight and I''ll give you a 10 - this is wonderfully observed and very well executed</td>', 'turn her around and stand her up straight and I''ll give you a 10 - this is wonderfully observed and very well executed', '2007-06-01 02:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722130, 524709, 24974, '<td valign="top">Sounds out of tune from here.  :-)</td>', 'Sounds out of tune from here.  :-)', '2007-06-01 02:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722131, 522882, 51793, '<td valign="top">Now this is a pretty sunset and then I hit the boat and can tell that you didn''t use a mask to remove the adjustment colors from the boat.</td>', 'Now this is a pretty sunset and then I hit the boat and can tell that you didn''t use a mask to remove the adjustment colors from the boat.', '2007-06-01 02:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722132, 518120, 24974, '<td valign="top">This really need to be bigger to be appreciated. Not a complaint, I know the rules specify size.</td>', 'This really need to be bigger to be appreciated. Not a complaint, I know the rules specify size.', '2007-06-01 02:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722133, 521570, 77343, '<td valign="top">i love the concept. i wish you had played with curves a bit more. gave it a 7</td>', 'i love the concept. i wish you had played with curves a bit more. gave it a 7', '2007-06-01 02:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722137, 524686, 24974, '<td valign="top">Wow, I would like to know what kind of shampoo the horse uses. Just spectacular.</td>', 'Wow, I would like to know what kind of shampoo the horse uses. Just spectacular.', '2007-06-01 02:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722138, 524253, 51793, '<td valign="top">She looks a little young but yes she is and that is a very beautiful dress. <br/>congratulationsto her. <br/> <br/>Great color and lighting, curves could really make her skin just right, they look a bit off. Other than that I think you have a wonderful shot.</td>', 'She looks a little young but yes she is and that is a very beautiful dress. congratulationsto her.  Great color and lighting, curves could really make her skin just right, they look a bit off. Other than that I think you have a wonderful shot.', '2007-06-01 02:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722139, 515978, 31403, '<td valign="top">second shot of this I''ve seen this week - what are the odds?<br/> <br/>Love this perspective, nicely observed with the reflection, and the flip made me stop and process - great work</td>', 'second shot of this I''ve seen this week - what are the odds? Love this perspective, nicely observed with the reflection, and the flip made me stop and process - great work', '2007-06-01 02:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
