(3722170, 525308, 31403, '<td valign="top">cool, I''d like to try a shot like this one of these days - any tips so my try could be half as cool as yours?</td>', 'cool, I''d like to try a shot like this one of these days - any tips so my try could be half as cool as yours?', '2007-06-01 02:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722176, 511770, 40430, '<td valign="top">simple and really works for me, great job.</td>', 'simple and really works for me, great job.', '2007-06-01 02:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722178, 524653, 24974, '<td valign="top">I hate squirrels (they''ve destroyed parts of my house and my kid''s swingset) but this little guy is cute.</td>', 'I hate squirrels (they''ve destroyed parts of my house and my kid''s swingset) but this little guy is cute.', '2007-06-01 02:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722181, 525329, 66398, '<td valign="top">Wow this would have been great for the four elements challenge if it were taken during that time frame.</td>', 'Wow this would have been great for the four elements challenge if it were taken during that time frame.', '2007-06-01 02:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722184, 513280, 31403, '<td valign="top">I think your subject kind of gets lost in the strong lines of this one - it wouldn''t take much to communicate the "city-ness" of the background, so I''d prefer keeping your subjects larger so the big strong geometrical shapes don''t compete so much with them.<br/> <br/>It''s a great piece - I''d like to see it cropped.  Cool processing that made me stop and think.</td>', 'I think your subject kind of gets lost in the strong lines of this one - it wouldn''t take much to communicate the "city-ness" of the background, so I''d prefer keeping your subjects larger so the big strong geometrical shapes don''t compete so much with them. It''s a great piece - I''d like to see it cropped.  Cool processing that made me stop and think.', '2007-06-01 02:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722185, 523673, 24974, '<td valign="top">There is nothing compelling about the building itself and the straight-on shot only accentuates that. Perhaps a different angle would have been a little more interesting.</td>', 'There is nothing compelling about the building itself and the straight-on shot only accentuates that. Perhaps a different angle would have been a little more interesting.', '2007-06-01 02:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722187, 521448, 40430, '<td valign="top">great composition and use of color.</td>', 'great composition and use of color.', '2007-06-01 02:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722191, 521396, 31403, '<td valign="top">color in the sky would be cool</td>', 'color in the sky would be cool', '2007-06-01 02:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722193, 524996, 24974, '<td valign="top">The trees are so prominent that I only noticed the falls after I started looking around the frame. A narrow vertical crop focusing on the falls with perhaps a little more foreground showing would have been nice. the people in the shot give a nice size reference.</td>', 'The trees are so prominent that I only noticed the falls after I started looking around the frame. A narrow vertical crop focusing on the falls with perhaps a little more foreground showing would have been nice. the people in the shot give a nice size reference.', '2007-06-01 02:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722198, 524623, 24974, '<td valign="top">I love the action feel of the shot. He looks like a lizard on a mission.</td>', 'I love the action feel of the shot. He looks like a lizard on a mission.', '2007-06-01 02:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722199, 524701, 66398, '<td valign="top">And this wasn''t in the four elements challenge because....?  This is a good shot. I like everything about it.</td>', 'And this wasn''t in the four elements challenge because....?  This is a good shot. I like everything about it.', '2007-06-01 02:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722200, 525092, 31403, '<td valign="top">oh what a tender photo - love the subject and the framing<br/> <br/>processing kills this for me.  I can see squashing your whites in the photo to bring out the subject more - but this just ends up lacking tonal range and contrast.  A reprocessed version I''d give you a 7.  This is great work -</td>', 'oh what a tender photo - love the subject and the framing processing kills this for me.  I can see squashing your whites in the photo to bring out the subject more - but this just ends up lacking tonal range and contrast.  A reprocessed version I''d give you a 7.  This is great work -', '2007-06-01 02:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722205, 525440, 24974, '<td valign="top">Cute, but lacking contrast. There is also some odd ghosting around the wheels that is distracting.</td>', 'Cute, but lacking contrast. There is also some odd ghosting around the wheels that is distracting.', '2007-06-01 02:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722210, 514094, 19831, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. Interesting subject. Great composition. Nice light. Nice job :-)</td>', 'Cool shot. Interesting subject. Great composition. Nice light. Nice job :-)', '2007-06-01 02:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722213, 513224, 24974, '<td valign="top">The colors are too muted and the overall contrast is too low.</td>', 'The colors are too muted and the overall contrast is too low.', '2007-06-01 02:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722217, 524345, 31403, '<td valign="top">use your tonal range to draw our attention to them - it''s all kind of one tone and my eye has to work to find what you are showing me.  The strong subject in the foreground dominates from a size perspective, so lighten the kids to give my eye a reason to move to the story you are really telling.<br/> <br/>Killer creative, amazing shot, really.  Just a little more work on directing your audiences eye and you''re ready for prime time. 7</td>', 'use your tonal range to draw our attention to them - it''s all kind of one tone and my eye has to work to find what you are showing me.  The strong subject in the foreground dominates from a size perspective, so lighten the kids to give my eye a reason to move to the story you are really telling. Killer creative, amazing shot, really.  Just a little more work on directing your audiences eye and you''re ready for prime time. 7', '2007-06-01 02:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722220, 524256, 24974, '<td valign="top">That is stinkin'' hilarious. Perhaps "Future Plumber" would have worked as a title too.</td>', 'That is stinkin'' hilarious. Perhaps "Future Plumber" would have worked as a title too.', '2007-06-01 02:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722221, 523822, 31403, '<td valign="top">this is unorthodox, and totally works for me - I appreciate your bravery in breaking some compositional rules - 7</td>', 'this is unorthodox, and totally works for me - I appreciate your bravery in breaking some compositional rules - 7', '2007-06-01 02:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722226, 522692, 31403, '<td valign="top">That''s ART - that''s big time hanging in a gallery, featured in a magazine, make you stop and think about the story - ART.  I''m afraid that will make it most un appreciated here - but 10 from me</td>', 'That''s ART - that''s big time hanging in a gallery, featured in a magazine, make you stop and think about the story - ART.  I''m afraid that will make it most un appreciated here - but 10 from me', '2007-06-01 02:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
