(3722247, 524844, 51793, '<td valign="top">She is very pretty. The tone of this image sis perfect. lighting is outstanding. Must be a window right next to her.<br/> <br/> <br/>What''s wrong with her nose???</td>', 'She is very pretty. The tone of this image sis perfect. lighting is outstanding. Must be a window right next to her.  What''s wrong with her nose???', '2007-06-01 02:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
