(3723035, 521973, 51793, '<td valign="top">Thi is a cute image and it looks like you had fun that day but that''s exaclty what it looks like (if you can understand that). <br/>Their really isn''t that much color so it''s hard to make something pop so for this I think I would have blured the background. Maybe a tighter crop to remove the large polar butt from the left side, or made the image broder (if you can) so you can see what is going one. JMO. Good luck.</td>', 'Thi is a cute image and it looks like you had fun that day but that''s exaclty what it looks like (if you can understand that). Their really isn''t that much color so it''s hard to make something pop so for this I think I would have blured the background. Maybe a tighter crop to remove the large polar butt from the left side, or made the image broder (if you can) so you can see what is going one. JMO. Good luck.', '2007-06-01 09:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
