(3723086, 525105, 25355, '<td valign="top">Unless you have really interesting dice, dice shots would be better with them in motion. As it is, I can''t tell what they''re resting on. (Plus, there''s no other thing linking this to Las Vegas other than they''re dice.)<br/>Vote 8.</td>', 'Unless you have really interesting dice, dice shots would be better with them in motion. As it is, I can''t tell what they''re resting on. (Plus, there''s no other thing linking this to Las Vegas other than they''re dice.)Vote 8.', '2007-06-01 09:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723088, 518278, 53548, '<td valign="top">lo-ve-it!</td>', 'lo-ve-it!', '2007-06-01 09:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723089, 514973, 30982, '<td valign="top">A lovely presentation.  I know the use of blur helps create the environment here (and a very cool and refreshing environment it is!) but I almost want just a wee bit more detail simply because it looks so lush I''d like to see more.  Very well done.</td>', 'A lovely presentation.  I know the use of blur helps create the environment here (and a very cool and refreshing environment it is!) but I almost want just a wee bit more detail simply because it looks so lush I''d like to see more.  Very well done.', '2007-06-01 09:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723091, 523759, 25355, '<td valign="top">I guess the Roman Catholic one is the closer one (if one of them is RC).<br/>Vote 9.</td>', 'I guess the Roman Catholic one is the closer one (if one of them is RC).Vote 9.', '2007-06-01 09:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723096, 524235, 30982, '<td valign="top">Some may find this "boring" - as in no "wow" factor.  I think it''s quite well composed - all the elements balance each other nicely and present a stark image which illustrates your title well.  For DPC purposes, you could always try dramatic vignetting or perhaps a B&amp;W with a strong duotone.  The basic photograph works fine for me as is.</td>', 'Some may find this "boring" - as in no "wow" factor.  I think it''s quite well composed - all the elements balance each other nicely and present a stark image which illustrates your title well.  For DPC purposes, you could always try dramatic vignetting or perhaps a B&W with a strong duotone.  The basic photograph works fine for me as is.', '2007-06-01 09:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723097, 525351, 25355, '<td valign="top">Nice. I wonder how deep the water is - I never think of flamingoes as actual swimmers, as they are more of a wading bird.<br/>Vote 10.</td>', 'Nice. I wonder how deep the water is - I never think of flamingoes as actual swimmers, as they are more of a wading bird.Vote 10.', '2007-06-01 09:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
