(3723374, 521966, 38509, '<td valign="top">beautiful ! cool colors are great and the little orange burst are awesome ... 10 from me</td>', 'beautiful ! cool colors are great and the little orange burst are awesome ... 10 from me', '2007-06-01 10:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723379, 521543, 15204, '<td valign="top">A beautiful capture of this little lark.  I think it is a little flat in the midtones.  Some contrast could really make this pop! I like the composition and your angle, with the horizon below the bird.  6 from me.</td>', 'A beautiful capture of this little lark.  I think it is a little flat in the midtones.  Some contrast could really make this pop! I like the composition and your angle, with the horizon below the bird.  6 from me.', '2007-06-01 10:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723383, 524263, 31403, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure why you would crop it to leave that brown thing in there - I''d recommend centering your subject vertically and cloning that brown tape out altogether - it''s a huge distraction.  Love the quirkiness of the theme.</td>', 'I''m not sure why you would crop it to leave that brown thing in there - I''d recommend centering your subject vertically and cloning that brown tape out altogether - it''s a huge distraction.  Love the quirkiness of the theme.', '2007-06-01 10:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723385, 519569, 58728, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  I think the eyes may be a bit too dark though.  Also, bumping up the contrast a bit more may help as well.  Hope this helps.  :)</td>', 'Nice composition.  I think the eyes may be a bit too dark though.  Also, bumping up the contrast a bit more may help as well.  Hope this helps.  :)', '2007-06-01 10:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
