(3723387, 525180, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the overall composition of this alot - the winding road and the rolling pasture land is lovely.  It appears, though, that a smoothing function of some kind (noise reduction, Neat Image, blur etc) has been used which has left some kinda muddy sections and removed some detail.</td>', 'I like the overall composition of this alot - the winding road and the rolling pasture land is lovely.  It appears, though, that a smoothing function of some kind (noise reduction, Neat Image, blur etc) has been used which has left some kinda muddy sections and removed some detail.', '2007-06-01 10:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
