(3723392, 523591, 30982, '<td valign="top">A lovely and well done study it is, too.</td>', 'A lovely and well done study it is, too.', '2007-06-01 10:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723395, 520909, 67152, '<td valign="top">Really nice perspective - I like the processing a lot on the buildings and trees, but there is something odd about the sky - I think it could be a little more vibrant in colors and contrast</td>', 'Really nice perspective - I like the processing a lot on the buildings and trees, but there is something odd about the sky - I think it could be a little more vibrant in colors and contrast', '2007-06-01 10:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723400, 512532, 43400, '<td valign="top">Great work of engineering and architecture. Good perspective and light; though if the sun was rising/setting in the opposite direction, you could capture the building''s entry. Somehow the other buildings in the background are a little distracting, so perhaps chosing a different angle would have worked better. I bet this would look good in B&amp;W also.</td>', 'Great work of engineering and architecture. Good perspective and light; though if the sun was rising/setting in the opposite direction, you could capture the building''s entry. Somehow the other buildings in the background are a little distracting, so perhaps chosing a different angle would have worked better. I bet this would look good in B&W also.', '2007-06-01 10:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723402, 523822, 30982, '<td valign="top">Quite lovely.  An warm sense of peace and beauty.</td>', 'Quite lovely.  An warm sense of peace and beauty.', '2007-06-01 10:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723407, 524784, 68035, '<td valign="top">Jeez, this photo has been driving me mad, because I am sure that I have seen it and commented on it before (or one very very similar).  KarenNFld is this one of yours (Though I cant see it in your portfolio so I may be wrong) If not are you stalking KarenNfld (or am I just going mad?)<br/> <br/>OK onto the pic, really beautiful leading lines and wonderful contrasts and tones, I love the bizarre architectural angles and the sky is perfect</td>', 'Jeez, this photo has been driving me mad, because I am sure that I have seen it and commented on it before (or one very very similar).  KarenNFld is this one of yours (Though I cant see it in your portfolio so I may be wrong) If not are you stalking KarenNfld (or am I just going mad?) OK onto the pic, really beautiful leading lines and wonderful contrasts and tones, I love the bizarre architectural angles and the sky is perfect', '2007-06-01 10:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723408, 525301, 43400, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured and good DOF in this macro. I like the blue background and motion detected.</td>', 'Nicely captured and good DOF in this macro. I like the blue background and motion detected.', '2007-06-01 10:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
