(3723456, 524520, 56797, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking. this is an incredibely beautiful, colorful scene with tons of depth. the hiker almost takes away from it for me. my eye wants to keep looking at him/her as the focus of the photo especially with your title choice even though the star here is this environment. I just cant keep from looking at the hiker long enough to fully appreciate the beauty of the land. Still just incredible. I hope you do very well with this. 9</td>', 'Breathtaking. this is an incredibely beautiful, colorful scene with tons of depth. the hiker almost takes away from it for me. my eye wants to keep looking at him/her as the focus of the photo especially with your title choice even though the star here is this environment. I just cant keep from looking at the hiker long enough to fully appreciate the beauty of the land. Still just incredible. I hope you do very well with this. 9', '2007-06-01 11:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723458, 524881, 67152, '<td valign="top">Great image - love the sharpness and contrast and the foreboding sky.</td>', 'Great image - love the sharpness and contrast and the foreboding sky.', '2007-06-01 11:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723460, 519809, 56797, '<td valign="top">a bit soft. the depth of field seems to be spot on. some added contrast and sharpening would work wonders here.</td>', 'a bit soft. the depth of field seems to be spot on. some added contrast and sharpening would work wonders here.', '2007-06-01 11:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
