(3723727, 507455, 35804, '<td valign="top">Fantastic...stillness and order coupled with motion and blur, black vs. white, negative space vs. positive space...all this makes this so interesting to look at. As I sit here turning my head I notice this is an image that would look great rotated in any direction...I really enjoy this.</td>', 'Fantastic...stillness and order coupled with motion and blur, black vs. white, negative space vs. positive space...all this makes this so interesting to look at. As I sit here turning my head I notice this is an image that would look great rotated in any direction...I really enjoy this.', '2007-06-01 11:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723728, 524078, 34938, '<td valign="top">I actually liked your image until I read your title...sorry :-( I just think that titles really can add or subtract from an image. In this case you have drawn our attention to the fact that your image might be cliche...perhaps ''Ruby Red Pearls'' or ''Scarlet Drops'' might have lifted this...just a thought. Never downgrade your image in the title and expect it to do well. Voters are not that kind...6</td>', 'I actually liked your image until I read your title...sorry :-( I just think that titles really can add or subtract from an image. In this case you have drawn our attention to the fact that your image might be cliche...perhaps ''Ruby Red Pearls'' or ''Scarlet Drops'' might have lifted this...just a thought. Never downgrade your image in the title and expect it to do well. Voters are not that kind...6', '2007-06-01 11:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
