(3725439, 525156, 46097, '<td valign="top">There''s something in this I quite like. Not sure what it is. I was just flicking thru photos, havent for ages, and was about to pass over yours, but checked in, and somehow felt I''d like to comment. Technically, its not perfect, but somehow it has a certain intangible something, a mood, a sense of action and liveliness. The billowing flowing sail, and her lively expression..........yep, it speaks to me. Well done. It''s a pity I no longer have an active vote here.</td>', 'There''s something in this I quite like. Not sure what it is. I was just flicking thru photos, havent for ages, and was about to pass over yours, but checked in, and somehow felt I''d like to comment. Technically, its not perfect, but somehow it has a certain intangible something, a mood, a sense of action and liveliness. The billowing flowing sail, and her lively expression..........yep, it speaks to me. Well done. It''s a pity I no longer have an active vote here.', '2007-06-01 18:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
