(3727143, 522776, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  The textures and tones are GREAT. If I were to change anything, I might dodge her shirt so that she is the POP of the picture and not the clouds, since they are lighter and her shirt is more of a midrange tone.  I like the hint of warmth - not just plain ol'' black and white.</td>', 'Nicely done.  The textures and tones are GREAT. If I were to change anything, I might dodge her shirt so that she is the POP of the picture and not the clouds, since they are lighter and her shirt is more of a midrange tone.  I like the hint of warmth - not just plain ol'' black and white.', '2007-06-02 00:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3727147, 524424, 15711, '<td valign="top">The focus is perfect. Love him against the wispy clouds. If it were mine, I''d make the sky a purer blue but that''s just my taste. No points off. Probably the best stop action of the challenge.</td>', 'The focus is perfect. Love him against the wispy clouds. If it were mine, I''d make the sky a purer blue but that''s just my taste. No points off. Probably the best stop action of the challenge.', '2007-06-02 00:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
