(3727163, 521448, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like the way the rain looks, and I like the division of the frame in half, and I like the strange mottled background. This elevates what could have been a corny concept. You have not exploited your model! :) 7</td>', 'I like the way the rain looks, and I like the division of the frame in half, and I like the strange mottled background. This elevates what could have been a corny concept. You have not exploited your model! :) 7', '2007-06-02 00:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3727164, 508412, 15711, '<td valign="top">I went back and forth on this one.  Love the horse and the way he is placed in the shot.  I love the red halter against his white colour. I like the hat but somehow it seems slightly off, as it covers part of the saddle/blanket.   I could lose it altogether and just have a larger image of the horse. He''s a gem. 7</td>', 'I went back and forth on this one.  Love the horse and the way he is placed in the shot.  I love the red halter against his white colour. I like the hat but somehow it seems slightly off, as it covers part of the saddle/blanket.   I could lose it altogether and just have a larger image of the horse. He''s a gem. 7', '2007-06-02 00:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3727165, 525098, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really well done. Love the bokeh.  The catchlight in that little eye - awwww.</td>', 'Really well done. Love the bokeh.  The catchlight in that little eye - awwww.', '2007-06-02 00:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3727167, 521396, 15711, '<td valign="top">What really makes the shot for me is the barn red on top of the lighthouse.  Your eye just zooms right to it.  Lovely texture of the rocks and clouds. Funny how they almost mimic each other. ;~D  Nice job.</td>', 'What really makes the shot for me is the barn red on top of the lighthouse.  Your eye just zooms right to it.  Lovely texture of the rocks and clouds. Funny how they almost mimic each other. ;~D  Nice job.', '2007-06-02 00:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
