(3727181, 524994, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the composition and how the ground sort of tilts and straightens out as we get to the building.  The movement of the people is wonderful. Great tones too.</td>', 'I love the composition and how the ground sort of tilts and straightens out as we get to the building.  The movement of the people is wonderful. Great tones too.', '2007-06-02 00:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
