(3727183, 524813, 59415, '<td valign="top">For some reason when I saw the first thing that popped in my head was the band tool.  I keep thinking this little statue dude is going to hurt me.</td>', 'For some reason when I saw the first thing that popped in my head was the band tool.  I keep thinking this little statue dude is going to hurt me.', '2007-06-02 00:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3727186, 520281, 15711, '<td valign="top">We see this landmark all the time but the HDR and BW combined just gives it so much depth and character.  I love it. The sky rocks.</td>', 'We see this landmark all the time but the HDR and BW combined just gives it so much depth and character.  I love it. The sky rocks.', '2007-06-02 00:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3727187, 525037, 47316, '<td valign="top">Pretty image. Love the colors and tones. The background is throwin git off a bit... I dunno, seems like it''s competing for attntion.</td>', 'Pretty image. Love the colors and tones. The background is throwin git off a bit... I dunno, seems like it''s competing for attntion.', '2007-06-02 00:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
