(3727193, 510768, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like the campy sincerity of the model, but the tight crop makes me feel like I''m missing something. A little mystery is good, but I don''t have quite enough information to even get a hint of the story I''m missing. This came close, though. 5</td>', 'I like the campy sincerity of the model, but the tight crop makes me feel like I''m missing something. A little mystery is good, but I don''t have quite enough information to even get a hint of the story I''m missing. This came close, though. 5', '2007-06-02 00:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
