(3727325, 517571, 51793, '<td valign="top">You did a good job with processing but the car isn''t all that intresting to me. I also think you went a little over board with the sharpening. See the halo around everything... = to much sharpen...</td>', 'You did a good job with processing but the car isn''t all that intresting to me. I also think you went a little over board with the sharpening. See the halo around everything... = to much sharpen...', '2007-06-02 01:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
