(3727388, 524711, 78255, '<td valign="top">Perfect timing and composition for this image. Good work.</td>', 'Perfect timing and composition for this image. Good work.', '2007-06-02 01:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3727389, 525412, 76941, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I like the diagonal lines. What are the spirals in the sky? Kinda wish you had croped out the light post on the left side, but then you would have lost some of the blue box so maybe not. Anyway, a nice image overall.</td>', 'Interesting. I like the diagonal lines. What are the spirals in the sky? Kinda wish you had croped out the light post on the left side, but then you would have lost some of the blue box so maybe not. Anyway, a nice image overall.', '2007-06-02 01:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3727390, 524483, 78255, '<td valign="top">Simple and beautiful. Very nice.</td>', 'Simple and beautiful. Very nice.', '2007-06-02 01:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3727398, 521528, 76941, '<td valign="top">I can''t beleive you got close enought to get this shot. Unfocused in places but under the circumstances I can see why. Not bad.</td>', 'I can''t beleive you got close enought to get this shot. Unfocused in places but under the circumstances I can see why. Not bad.', '2007-06-02 01:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3727401, 510922, 24974, '<td valign="top">Why are some areas so blurry. It really ruins the picture for me.</td>', 'Why are some areas so blurry. It really ruins the picture for me.', '2007-06-02 01:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3727406, 522481, 24974, '<td valign="top">The effect is too strong for me.</td>', 'The effect is too strong for me.', '2007-06-02 01:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3727407, 522277, 76941, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea. I might have cropped a little closer.</td>', 'Not a bad idea. I might have cropped a little closer.', '2007-06-02 01:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3727415, 523585, 78255, '<td valign="top">It is almost an optical illusion. If I lean back and look, it looks like I am looking up through a canopy of tree limbs and leaves in IR. It took me a minute to realize I am looking at cracked parched dry earth. I like this type of image that makes me think, and not a flashy think type image like "how did they do that", but one that evokes an illusion subtly.</td>', 'It is almost an optical illusion. If I lean back and look, it looks like I am looking up through a canopy of tree limbs and leaves in IR. It took me a minute to realize I am looking at cracked parched dry earth. I like this type of image that makes me think, and not a flashy think type image like "how did they do that", but one that evokes an illusion subtly.', '2007-06-02 01:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3727433, 525389, 78255, '<td valign="top">I would like this better if her face was more natural, without so much color on her cheeks and temples. Or is that a bruise?</td>', 'I would like this better if her face was more natural, without so much color on her cheeks and temples. Or is that a bruise?', '2007-06-02 02:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3727436, 524628, 78255, '<td valign="top">The composition works very well for me. I am drawn into the scene.</td>', 'The composition works very well for me. I am drawn into the scene.', '2007-06-02 02:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3727461, 525059, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF and lighting. But the processing took a lot out of the detail of the birds feathers. Looks like the saturation has been pumped up and has blown out key features.</td>', 'Nice DOF and lighting. But the processing took a lot out of the detail of the birds feathers. Looks like the saturation has been pumped up and has blown out key features.', '2007-06-02 02:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3727473, 525351, 22970, '<td valign="top">A nice shot but the compositions really makes the subject boring. I would of cropped in tighter to focus more on the delicate bird and its flowing feathers and color, leaving out most of the water around that distracts me from the subject. Not a bad shot it''s just not presented the best way, IMO.</td>', 'A nice shot but the compositions really makes the subject boring. I would of cropped in tighter to focus more on the delicate bird and its flowing feathers and color, leaving out most of the water around that distracts me from the subject. Not a bad shot it''s just not presented the best way, IMO.', '2007-06-02 02:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3727493, 516362, 56895, '<td valign="top">Great use of colour and focus</td>', 'Great use of colour and focus', '2007-06-02 02:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3727497, 521973, 56895, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture of cub.</td>', 'Beautiful picture of cub.', '2007-06-02 02:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
