(3727523, 519696, 56895, '<td valign="top">Without looking at the title of the picture, I was wondering what I was seeing, but the colours here have emotion so once I saw the title it made sense to me.</td>', 'Without looking at the title of the picture, I was wondering what I was seeing, but the colours here have emotion so once I saw the title it made sense to me.', '2007-06-02 02:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
