(3727656, 523974, 39531, '<td valign="top">very nice saturation and use of shadows. I find the glare on the water to be distracting ... I think I would have prefered not to have the boat there either adds too modern a look. Wonderful greens ...</td>', 'very nice saturation and use of shadows. I find the glare on the water to be distracting ... I think I would have prefered not to have the boat there either adds too modern a look. Wonderful greens ...', '2007-06-02 03:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
