(3727667, 524685, 39531, '<td valign="top">great color, sharpness and exposure. I like the vibrant colors the only thing I don''t care for is the excessive hot spot from where I assume the sun is setting. Would a graduated ND filter have helped that ?</td>', 'great color, sharpness and exposure. I like the vibrant colors the only thing I don''t care for is the excessive hot spot from where I assume the sun is setting. Would a graduated ND filter have helped that ?', '2007-06-02 03:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
