(3728673, 522630, 15711, '<td valign="top">So peaceful and serene.  I love how the boats are all lined up creating a horizontal line. Nice work.  The yellows pop from the other grayer tones of the shot.</td>', 'So peaceful and serene.  I love how the boats are all lined up creating a horizontal line. Nice work.  The yellows pop from the other grayer tones of the shot.', '2007-06-02 12:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728678, 517272, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is well done and unexpected. I like the natural framing of the wood to the left of the boots.  Great lighting and tones.  This has a nostalgic sense and could be emotive on many levels. Maybe a soldier, maybe a worker, or even a relic of someone who has passed on and they are shining down their light on their old shoes.</td>', 'This is well done and unexpected. I like the natural framing of the wood to the left of the boots.  Great lighting and tones.  This has a nostalgic sense and could be emotive on many levels. Maybe a soldier, maybe a worker, or even a relic of someone who has passed on and they are shining down their light on their old shoes.', '2007-06-02 12:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728684, 512322, 15711, '<td valign="top">We see many bug/flower shots and this is a really good example.  The DOF and the detail is well done.  I love how the black of the bee is the only dark tone in the shot so he really pops. I can almost feel his fuzzy body. There is a touch of a hot spot on his mid abdomen, but not enough to detract from the overall appeal of this image.</td>', 'We see many bug/flower shots and this is a really good example.  The DOF and the detail is well done.  I love how the black of the bee is the only dark tone in the shot so he really pops. I can almost feel his fuzzy body. There is a touch of a hot spot on his mid abdomen, but not enough to detract from the overall appeal of this image.', '2007-06-02 12:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728690, 524881, 15711, '<td valign="top">Well done.  I love all of the gray tonal variants with hints of beige and turquoise here and there.  Great perspective.  The clouds are wonderful with the rain coming down. The angular aspec works so well.  I''m assuming this is HDR - well edited my friend.</td>', 'Well done.  I love all of the gray tonal variants with hints of beige and turquoise here and there.  Great perspective.  The clouds are wonderful with the rain coming down. The angular aspec works so well.  I''m assuming this is HDR - well edited my friend.', '2007-06-02 12:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728695, 520038, 15711, '<td valign="top">A perfect title.  I love the lighting on his face and the beautiful bokeh in the background. Sometimes bokeh in black and white just looks like blobs but this has an almost blurred line to it from light to darker at the bottom (in the highlights) and it frames his face nicely. His eyes are wonderful.</td>', 'A perfect title.  I love the lighting on his face and the beautiful bokeh in the background. Sometimes bokeh in black and white just looks like blobs but this has an almost blurred line to it from light to darker at the bottom (in the highlights) and it frames his face nicely. His eyes are wonderful.', '2007-06-02 12:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728704, 523436, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the natural framing of the bricked in doorway.  Her blue jeans have a nice POP yet they complement the steel blue of the cement blocks. This has a certain emotive quality to it as well.</td>', 'I like the natural framing of the bricked in doorway.  Her blue jeans have a nice POP yet they complement the steel blue of the cement blocks. This has a certain emotive quality to it as well.', '2007-06-02 12:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728713, 523821, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''m a huge fan of the old cars. I like the tonal range of this one. The perspective is good.  I''m wondering if a touch of contrast or selective colour (neutral - reduce the black) adjustment would really make the highlights pop a bit more.  Or maybe even dodge around the wide sidewalls of the tires. Just a thought. Love the reflective bumper! It has a bit of a tight feeling with the crop. I''d like to see the entire vehicle, but given the circumstances, maybe there were distracting things around and that isn''t possible.</td>', 'I''m a huge fan of the old cars. I like the tonal range of this one. The perspective is good.  I''m wondering if a touch of contrast or selective colour (neutral - reduce the black) adjustment would really make the highlights pop a bit more.  Or maybe even dodge around the wide sidewalls of the tires. Just a thought. Love the reflective bumper! It has a bit of a tight feeling with the crop. I''d like to see the entire vehicle, but given the circumstances, maybe there were distracting things around and that isn''t possible.', '2007-06-02 12:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728716, 524281, 15711, '<td valign="top">A lovely night shot.  I like that the sky isn''t completely black.  The hint of lighter tones indicate some night clouds.  The reflective quality speaks for itself. Well done.</td>', 'A lovely night shot.  I like that the sky isn''t completely black.  The hint of lighter tones indicate some night clouds.  The reflective quality speaks for itself. Well done.', '2007-06-02 12:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728718, 525162, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is different and unexpected for the challenge.  I love it.  The detail on the vice and the cracked egg is great.  Perfect in black and white - it showcases all of the various tonal ranges from white to gray to charcoal to back.  The title is perfect.</td>', 'This is different and unexpected for the challenge.  I love it.  The detail on the vice and the cracked egg is great.  Perfect in black and white - it showcases all of the various tonal ranges from white to gray to charcoal to back.  The title is perfect.', '2007-06-02 12:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728720, 519276, 15711, '<td valign="top">One of the better bug macros. I love that he''s upside down. The vivid lime grean really makes the black of his antennae, eyes and wings POP off of the page. Not sure about the thickness of the frame, but no points taken for that. :~D</td>', 'One of the better bug macros. I love that he''s upside down. The vivid lime grean really makes the black of his antennae, eyes and wings POP off of the page. Not sure about the thickness of the frame, but no points taken for that. :~D', '2007-06-02 13:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728722, 511958, 12311, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting!  I think a little perspective correction would help this image, but as-is it''s still very fine work.</td>', 'Excellent lighting!  I think a little perspective correction would help this image, but as-is it''s still very fine work.', '2007-06-02 13:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728724, 512000, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely landscape.  The perspective is excellent.  I like that single old broken off branch poking into the shot from the left.  Great sky colour.  The clouds really add something to the upper part of the shot.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Lovely landscape.  The perspective is excellent.  I like that single old broken off branch poking into the shot from the left.  Great sky colour.  The clouds really add something to the upper part of the shot.  Nicely done.', '2007-06-02 13:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728725, 511167, 60173, '<td valign="top">Fantastic capture! This is one of those photos that is what photography is about; capturing life. Centuries from now people can look back at this photo and learn from it. <br/> <br/>I wish there was more light in the shadows, but that''s life, heh.</td>', 'Fantastic capture! This is one of those photos that is what photography is about; capturing life. Centuries from now people can look back at this photo and learn from it.  I wish there was more light in the shadows, but that''s life, heh.', '2007-06-02 13:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728727, 524969, 12311, '<td valign="top">That hot spot on the right detracts from this image.  Otherwise, quite well done.</td>', 'That hot spot on the right detracts from this image.  Otherwise, quite well done.', '2007-06-02 13:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728729, 511316, 15711, '<td valign="top">The composition and focus are spot on.  I love how the clouds create a beautiful diagonal over the old brick structure. This is RGB at its best.  If I were to critique anythying, maybe lighten up the blue tone a smidge. Otherwise - GREAT!!!</td>', 'The composition and focus are spot on.  I love how the clouds create a beautiful diagonal over the old brick structure. This is RGB at its best.  If I were to critique anythying, maybe lighten up the blue tone a smidge. Otherwise - GREAT!!!', '2007-06-02 13:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728731, 521179, 12311, '<td valign="top">Nice range of tones and depth of field.</td>', 'Nice range of tones and depth of field.', '2007-06-02 13:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728734, 508959, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nicely caught.  What I love about this is the sharp tack edge of the silhouette.  There is no blur and it is just so distinctive. Man, I can see each individual line connecting the diver. The line of the parachute is spectacular and the yellow and diagonal red stripe really adds more POP.  Well done. Bumping up.</td>', 'Nicely caught.  What I love about this is the sharp tack edge of the silhouette.  There is no blur and it is just so distinctive. Man, I can see each individual line connecting the diver. The line of the parachute is spectacular and the yellow and diagonal red stripe really adds more POP.  Well done. Bumping up.', '2007-06-02 13:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728739, 521448, 15711, '<td valign="top">Wonderful and perfect title.  The selective desat works in this case.  I love the points of the maple leaves in juxtaposition with the blurred drops of the water.  This has a nice balance and symmetry, but not in the typical sense.</td>', 'Wonderful and perfect title.  The selective desat works in this case.  I love the points of the maple leaves in juxtaposition with the blurred drops of the water.  This has a nice balance and symmetry, but not in the typical sense.', '2007-06-02 13:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728742, 524262, 12311, '<td valign="top">Great title!  Wonderful color!  The only thing I''d change is to have a closer crop around the heads - just a smidgen too much background on the the top.  Overall, very well done.</td>', 'Great title!  Wonderful color!  The only thing I''d change is to have a closer crop around the heads - just a smidgen too much background on the the top.  Overall, very well done.', '2007-06-02 13:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728743, 507577, 12311, '<td valign="top">I''m sure there''s some member of his species who loves him...</td>', 'I''m sure there''s some member of his species who loves him...', '2007-06-02 13:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728765, 513337, 39531, '<td valign="top">with a smaller apeture would there have been better definition in the flowers or is a a lighting issue ?</td>', 'with a smaller apeture would there have been better definition in the flowers or is a a lighting issue ?', '2007-06-02 13:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728767, 524571, 39531, '<td valign="top">Very nice detail and color. I would have liked there to be a bit more light on the right side.</td>', 'Very nice detail and color. I would have liked there to be a bit more light on the right side.', '2007-06-02 13:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
