(3728811, 509818, 39531, '<td valign="top">nice detail but, the one baby''s eyes being closed and not light in the either of the eyes makes it less compelling to me.</td>', 'nice detail but, the one baby''s eyes being closed and not light in the either of the eyes makes it less compelling to me.', '2007-06-02 13:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
