(3728821, 525437, 39531, '<td valign="top">I don''t mind the partial trees on both sides the excessive blue on the top right I find distracting and overall I find the shot to be just a bit too dark</td>', 'I don''t mind the partial trees on both sides the excessive blue on the top right I find distracting and overall I find the shot to be just a bit too dark', '2007-06-02 13:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728823, 512139, 19978, '<td valign="top">Awesome storm shot. The clouds have mammatus appearance, and it appears that you used a longish exposure and captured some movement. I''m glad you captured some horizon because it''s absolutely essential to add some perspective to any sky shot for a sense of scale. However, I don''t think the photo has enough Wow Factor to really drive the score up. Still, good eye for storms. I hope you were safe!</td>', 'Awesome storm shot. The clouds have mammatus appearance, and it appears that you used a longish exposure and captured some movement. I''m glad you captured some horizon because it''s absolutely essential to add some perspective to any sky shot for a sense of scale. However, I don''t think the photo has enough Wow Factor to really drive the score up. Still, good eye for storms. I hope you were safe!', '2007-06-02 13:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728824, 517272, 70514, '<td valign="top">Something so simple sure says a lot.  I like the texture and lighting.</td>', 'Something so simple sure says a lot.  I like the texture and lighting.', '2007-06-02 13:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728825, 525196, 75651, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, I really do like the feeling of a bentle breeze gliding through the photo.  Nice composition.  nicely done!</td>', 'Beautiful colors, I really do like the feeling of a bentle breeze gliding through the photo.  Nice composition.  nicely done!', '2007-06-02 13:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
