(3729224, 525425, 19978, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing this is from the Chicago GTG. ;-) While I like the BW conversation and the composition with the shiny path-wall in the foreground (with great lines receding into the distance), the skyscrapers have an odd distortion to them, as though they''re warping to the left. It gives the image a surreal sense of falling over.</td>', 'I''m guessing this is from the Chicago GTG. ;-) While I like the BW conversation and the composition with the shiny path-wall in the foreground (with great lines receding into the distance), the skyscrapers have an odd distortion to them, as though they''re warping to the left. It gives the image a surreal sense of falling over.', '2007-06-02 15:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
