(3729486, 518334, 47316, '<td valign="top">Caught very well! The yellows are really nice, a color I don''t often see around california! Love the light coming from behind the leaves and the DOF. Could have more interesting composition.</td>', 'Caught very well! The yellows are really nice, a color I don''t often see around california! Love the light coming from behind the leaves and the DOF. Could have more interesting composition.', '2007-06-02 17:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729489, 525395, 47316, '<td valign="top">Image seems a little flat to me. I can see the storm but really the image makes me think calm more than storm with the sort of pastel colors everywhere. Playing with shadows/highlights and the tones of the greens I think could have conveyed the storm more. Perhaps even some burning towards where the grass meets the moutains to add some depth.</td>', 'Image seems a little flat to me. I can see the storm but really the image makes me think calm more than storm with the sort of pastel colors everywhere. Playing with shadows/highlights and the tones of the greens I think could have conveyed the storm more. Perhaps even some burning towards where the grass meets the moutains to add some depth.', '2007-06-02 17:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729495, 523570, 47316, '<td valign="top">I think if the stained glass was the focus of the shot you could have captured it a bit better. The colors seem really saturated and then the clear parts blown out. Underexposure and then using fill flash would have helped that. I see it must have been a difficult environment being that it was probably pretty dark inside.</td>', 'I think if the stained glass was the focus of the shot you could have captured it a bit better. The colors seem really saturated and then the clear parts blown out. Underexposure and then using fill flash would have helped that. I see it must have been a difficult environment being that it was probably pretty dark inside.', '2007-06-02 17:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729498, 510550, 47316, '<td valign="top">Pretty image. Nice use of color to bring it all together. I might have cropped a little tighter on the lamps but that''s a personal choice. Probably would have gone with a different title, doesn''t seem to match the image to me.</td>', 'Pretty image. Nice use of color to bring it all together. I might have cropped a little tighter on the lamps but that''s a personal choice. Probably would have gone with a different title, doesn''t seem to match the image to me.', '2007-06-02 17:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
