(3729511, 523903, 47316, '<td valign="top">Judgeing by the title the focus should be the child. That being said I would like to see more of him, crop tighter, less of the sky above the goal I think would be good. A different angle would work to get more of his body in the shot. I''d say play up the colors more also, this image has really dull colors.</td>', 'Judgeing by the title the focus should be the child. That being said I would like to see more of him, crop tighter, less of the sky above the goal I think would be good. A different angle would work to get more of his body in the shot. I''d say play up the colors more also, this image has really dull colors.', '2007-06-02 17:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
