(3730117, 525061, 60173, '<td valign="top">Time for a new fence! heh<br/> <br/>Great overall photo. Everything about the fence says rustic and takes you back to your childhood fishing hole. Without the cobweb this photo wouldn''t have nearly the same effect. Could live without the bird crap, but it adds its own special touch, heh.</td>', 'Time for a new fence! heh Great overall photo. Everything about the fence says rustic and takes you back to your childhood fishing hole. Without the cobweb this photo wouldn''t have nearly the same effect. Could live without the bird crap, but it adds its own special touch, heh.', '2007-06-02 21:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3730124, 525022, 60173, '<td valign="top">That''s an awesome catch. I''m not sold on the crop/composition.</td>', 'That''s an awesome catch. I''m not sold on the crop/composition.', '2007-06-02 21:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3730125, 524675, 60173, '<td valign="top">I see a very pretty natural girl... with what appears to be eyebrow make-up? Something very funky going on with the eyebrows. Very pretty photo though. I like the composition. Even though there''s a breast in the photo the focus is still her eyes. Very tasteful nude.</td>', 'I see a very pretty natural girl... with what appears to be eyebrow make-up? Something very funky going on with the eyebrows. Very pretty photo though. I like the composition. Even though there''s a breast in the photo the focus is still her eyes. Very tasteful nude.', '2007-06-02 21:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3730127, 520208, 60173, '<td valign="top">This looks a little dark to me. Otherwise, great shot.</td>', 'This looks a little dark to me. Otherwise, great shot.', '2007-06-02 21:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3730128, 524784, 60173, '<td valign="top">Whee! Great composition. The lines really pull you through the photo.</td>', 'Whee! Great composition. The lines really pull you through the photo.', '2007-06-02 21:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3730135, 519617, 60173, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors. I think your DOF was just a hair too shallow. Something about the crop doesn''t sit right either, but I can''t put my finger on which crop would look better.<br/> <br/>Actually, flipping it vertically looks pretty cool. Now when I look at it right-side-up it looks wrong, heh. Try the vertical flip. It makes your really shallow DOF sorta make sense. The shimmering whites that are currently on top look like water when you flip it. So the leaves look like they''re sitting in the water.</td>', 'Beautiful colors. I think your DOF was just a hair too shallow. Something about the crop doesn''t sit right either, but I can''t put my finger on which crop would look better. Actually, flipping it vertically looks pretty cool. Now when I look at it right-side-up it looks wrong, heh. Try the vertical flip. It makes your really shallow DOF sorta make sense. The shimmering whites that are currently on top look like water when you flip it. So the leaves look like they''re sitting in the water.', '2007-06-02 21:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3730136, 524518, 60173, '<td valign="top">Pity your whites blew out in the editing and compression. I do like how the sun puts ripples rings in your sky. It adds a nice depth in the greys. I would have cropped a little bit more to get the bottom right "thing" out of there. You also look just a hair tilted. I like the composition and the black and white works very well for this.</td>', 'Pity your whites blew out in the editing and compression. I do like how the sun puts ripples rings in your sky. It adds a nice depth in the greys. I would have cropped a little bit more to get the bottom right "thing" out of there. You also look just a hair tilted. I like the composition and the black and white works very well for this.', '2007-06-02 21:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3730139, 524724, 60173, '<td valign="top">lol he looks so surprised to see you. I can''t think of anything to help you improve the shot. I''ll just enjoy it instead!</td>', 'lol he looks so surprised to see you. I can''t think of anything to help you improve the shot. I''ll just enjoy it instead!', '2007-06-02 21:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3730142, 525354, 60173, '<td valign="top">I would have taken the greens out of this photo or changed their hue. Pity about the fence being there. Very cool little bridge/tunnel.</td>', 'I would have taken the greens out of this photo or changed their hue. Pity about the fence being there. Very cool little bridge/tunnel.', '2007-06-02 21:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3730144, 525287, 60173, '<td valign="top">Love the photo. Hate the fake frame. It really cheapens the photo.</td>', 'Love the photo. Hate the fake frame. It really cheapens the photo.', '2007-06-02 21:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
