(3730575, 515284, 51793, '<td valign="top">If the car next to this one wasn''t reflecting all over it I think this would be a better shot. The sky is plain and could really use some clouds or color and the ground is a bit plain as well.<br/> <br/>When shooting car shots try to have them away from anything else and at this angle try to capture some coulds, early in the AM or later in the afternoon.<br/> <br/>On a car of this color I would go for the afternoon because of the bright red, yellow and sometimes purplish skys. <br/> <br/>Good luck</td>', 'If the car next to this one wasn''t reflecting all over it I think this would be a better shot. The sky is plain and could really use some clouds or color and the ground is a bit plain as well. When shooting car shots try to have them away from anything else and at this angle try to capture some coulds, early in the AM or later in the afternoon. On a car of this color I would go for the afternoon because of the bright red, yellow and sometimes purplish skys.  Good luck', '2007-06-03 00:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
