(3731016, 511308, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very good job on the lighting here. Looks nice. Have you tried a slightly tighter crop? It just seems like especially bottom of frame, there feels like a bit too much negative space. A lovely shot though :-)</td>', 'Very good job on the lighting here. Looks nice. Have you tried a slightly tighter crop? It just seems like especially bottom of frame, there feels like a bit too much negative space. A lovely shot though :-)', '2007-06-03 04:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
