(3732937, 517372, 15711, '<td valign="top">The focus and DOF are spot on.  I think what hurts it a bit is the blown out brightness of the stalk. With advanced editing, you could burn it, or even paint it using a soft brush with a tad darker green. I like all of the various shades of colour on the bug''s back.  Nice bokeh as well. ;~D</td>', 'The focus and DOF are spot on.  I think what hurts it a bit is the blown out brightness of the stalk. With advanced editing, you could burn it, or even paint it using a soft brush with a tad darker green. I like all of the various shades of colour on the bug''s back.  Nice bokeh as well. ;~D', '2007-06-03 17:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
