(3733015, 510922, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has a story.  I like the partial blur - almost as if he''s part of a dream sequence.  The lines of the crosswalk and the dashes in the road pull our eye through the shot.</td>', 'This has a story.  I like the partial blur - almost as if he''s part of a dream sequence.  The lines of the crosswalk and the dashes in the road pull our eye through the shot.', '2007-06-03 17:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
