(3733018, 521055, 42567, '<td valign="top">nice b/w!  Makes me a little dizzy, lol.  9</td>', 'nice b/w!  Makes me a little dizzy, lol.  9', '2007-06-03 17:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3733022, 521574, 15711, '<td valign="top">The intensity of colour is lovely.  Actually one of my favorite: magenta.  The reflection in the drop is perfect.  Loving the bokeh.  I don''t know if it has  POW that some viewers want in a Free Study, but it certainly holds its own and is well done for a narrow DOF. ;~D 7</td>', 'The intensity of colour is lovely.  Actually one of my favorite: magenta.  The reflection in the drop is perfect.  Loving the bokeh.  I don''t know if it has  POW that some viewers want in a Free Study, but it certainly holds its own and is well done for a narrow DOF. ;~D 7', '2007-06-03 18:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3733024, 524881, 21621, '<td valign="top">Very nice cityscape, great work.</td>', 'Very nice cityscape, great work.', '2007-06-03 18:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3733025, 520737, 42567, '<td valign="top">now that is just wild looking.  nice capture!</td>', 'now that is just wild looking.  nice capture!', '2007-06-03 18:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3733028, 523688, 42567, '<td valign="top">awesome!  One of my favs during the challenge!  10</td>', 'awesome!  One of my favs during the challenge!  10', '2007-06-03 18:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3733029, 520759, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think this lacks the punch it could have if the contrast were more severe.  It really is just mid and shadow tones, yet doesn''t have that true low key approach.  I love the lines on their faces. The symmetry and balance are good too. I like the hint of bokeh in the background being lighter because it showcases their profiles.</td>', 'I think this lacks the punch it could have if the contrast were more severe.  It really is just mid and shadow tones, yet doesn''t have that true low key approach.  I love the lines on their faces. The symmetry and balance are good too. I like the hint of bokeh in the background being lighter because it showcases their profiles.', '2007-06-03 18:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3733036, 517617, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the high key approach. Coming back for a 2nd view. I seriously think this would be KILLER in black and white. There are certainly enough contrasting values to make it really pop. His eyes are just amazing and you can count each individual eyelash and brow hair.  Great focus.</td>', 'I love the high key approach. Coming back for a 2nd view. I seriously think this would be KILLER in black and white. There are certainly enough contrasting values to make it really pop. His eyes are just amazing and you can count each individual eyelash and brow hair.  Great focus.', '2007-06-03 18:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3733038, 522217, 42567, '<td valign="top">nice!!  Lovin the fog!  9</td>', 'nice!!  Lovin the fog!  9', '2007-06-03 18:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3733039, 510041, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the vintage feel of it.  The rolled up pants legs and the sandy toes. For me, something is lacking and I can''t quite put my finger on it. I''m such a fan of over editing though, that maybe I''m judging it too harshly. I wonder what playing with the unsharp mask would do to it. Just a thought. ;~D</td>', 'I like the vintage feel of it.  The rolled up pants legs and the sandy toes. For me, something is lacking and I can''t quite put my finger on it. I''m such a fan of over editing though, that maybe I''m judging it too harshly. I wonder what playing with the unsharp mask would do to it. Just a thought. ;~D', '2007-06-03 18:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3733047, 522692, 21621, '<td valign="top">Super image, very "jj".  One thing bugging me is the soft border on the right.  Overall one of the best of this challenge.</td>', 'Super image, very "jj".  One thing bugging me is the soft border on the right.  Overall one of the best of this challenge.', '2007-06-03 18:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3733048, 511638, 15711, '<td valign="top">I just really like this.  Like the baby is leaving the nest and the parent is sadly watching him fly away. I love the perfect black background. THe hint of yellow in the dandelion works well. Great use of neg. space as well. You nailed the rule of thirds too. Good luck. 7</td>', 'I just really like this.  Like the baby is leaving the nest and the parent is sadly watching him fly away. I love the perfect black background. THe hint of yellow in the dandelion works well. Great use of neg. space as well. You nailed the rule of thirds too. Good luck. 7', '2007-06-03 18:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3733050, 524644, 42567, '<td valign="top">great capture!!</td>', 'great capture!!', '2007-06-03 18:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3733053, 521077, 42567, '<td valign="top">Very very nice!  Love the golden look this has!  One of my fav</td>', 'Very very nice!  Love the golden look this has!  One of my fav', '2007-06-03 18:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3733054, 509894, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice simple contrast.  The vivid magenta/purply flower really POPS from the white. It may lack the powerful oomph needed for a high scoring Free Study, but certainly worthy of entering. 6 from me.</td>', 'Nice simple contrast.  The vivid magenta/purply flower really POPS from the white. It may lack the powerful oomph needed for a high scoring Free Study, but certainly worthy of entering. 6 from me.', '2007-06-03 18:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3733055, 507967, 42567, '<td valign="top">now thats just wild looking!</td>', 'now thats just wild looking!', '2007-06-03 18:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3733056, 524622, 42567, '<td valign="top">awesome!  10</td>', 'awesome!  10', '2007-06-03 18:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3733058, 519902, 42567, '<td valign="top">great picture and title!</td>', 'great picture and title!', '2007-06-03 18:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3733065, 525389, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''m a huge fan of over editing but this just isn''t working for me.  It may be that the intensity of the colours in combination with the apple, pearls, netting wrapped around her and the leaves make so much texture, that I''m yearning for a simpler finish.  To me, it would be killer in black and white.  Not bad by any means (in my eye) but maybe a bit too busy when you combine the intense tones and various textures. 6 from me.</td>', 'I''m a huge fan of over editing but this just isn''t working for me.  It may be that the intensity of the colours in combination with the apple, pearls, netting wrapped around her and the leaves make so much texture, that I''m yearning for a simpler finish.  To me, it would be killer in black and white.  Not bad by any means (in my eye) but maybe a bit too busy when you combine the intense tones and various textures. 6 from me.', '2007-06-03 18:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3733072, 523200, 15711, '<td valign="top">Simple and emotive.  I love the lonely quality of it. The hint of peachy/brown works to make us think of a long ago time. The clouds'' textures are beautiful against the smoother sky of the horizon and the wispy blades of grass. The bare spindly branches of the trees seem to be reaching up to touch the cloudy sky. I''d love it if a single silhouette of a person, horse, or something were alone on the right area.  Just me thinking out loud.</td>', 'Simple and emotive.  I love the lonely quality of it. The hint of peachy/brown works to make us think of a long ago time. The clouds'' textures are beautiful against the smoother sky of the horizon and the wispy blades of grass. The bare spindly branches of the trees seem to be reaching up to touch the cloudy sky. I''d love it if a single silhouette of a person, horse, or something were alone on the right area.  Just me thinking out loud.', '2007-06-03 18:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3733077, 524724, 15711, '<td valign="top">It''s like he''s holding a bugle. I wish his body were a touch more detailed. The unsharp mask or sharpen filter might fix that.  I love how his legs are out on one side and by his side on the other. Well focused and captured.</td>', 'It''s like he''s holding a bugle. I wish his body were a touch more detailed. The unsharp mask or sharpen filter might fix that.  I love how his legs are out on one side and by his side on the other. Well focused and captured.', '2007-06-03 18:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3733083, 525092, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen several other images with this type of "no highlights" editing.  I think it works ok with this shot, although I wonder what having some brighter whites would do to it.  It remeinds me of an old photo, which may be your intent. Composition and square crop really suits it.</td>', 'I''ve seen several other images with this type of "no highlights" editing.  I think it works ok with this shot, although I wonder what having some brighter whites would do to it.  It remeinds me of an old photo, which may be your intent. Composition and square crop really suits it.', '2007-06-03 18:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3733084, 507665, 15711, '<td valign="top">It''s a shame we can''t use the 800 pixels in an image like this so that we can really see more detail of her face. I like how the netting swirls around her. She has lovely eyes.  I wonder if it''s me, but I''d do a touch of sharpen on her face.</td>', 'It''s a shame we can''t use the 800 pixels in an image like this so that we can really see more detail of her face. I like how the netting swirls around her. She has lovely eyes.  I wonder if it''s me, but I''d do a touch of sharpen on her face.', '2007-06-03 18:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3733089, 523921, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the story of this.  The composition is well done.  Nice lighting and exposure for a night shot. I want to know what he''s carrying in his satchel. ;~D The wording on the window is a touch distracting.  I wonder if you could diminish it a smidge?  I like the silver and gold tones with the pops of black.</td>', 'I like the story of this.  The composition is well done.  Nice lighting and exposure for a night shot. I want to know what he''s carrying in his satchel. ;~D The wording on the window is a touch distracting.  I wonder if you could diminish it a smidge?  I like the silver and gold tones with the pops of black.', '2007-06-03 18:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3733112, 524384, 56254, '<td valign="top">wish the eyes were sharper</td>', 'wish the eyes were sharper', '2007-06-03 18:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3733114, 524254, 56254, '<td valign="top">this could use a boost in contrast to really make the flower pop from the background</td>', 'this could use a boost in contrast to really make the flower pop from the background', '2007-06-03 18:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3733120, 522361, 56254, '<td valign="top">great image ... I''d love to see this in portrait orientation</td>', 'great image ... I''d love to see this in portrait orientation', '2007-06-03 18:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3733123, 525303, 56254, '<td valign="top">selective desat isn''t working for me here ... would love to see this in B/W ...</td>', 'selective desat isn''t working for me here ... would love to see this in B/W ...', '2007-06-03 18:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3733125, 525029, 56254, '<td valign="top">the noise and grain work well here ... sepia tones really give this an old fashioned feel ... nice job</td>', 'the noise and grain work well here ... sepia tones really give this an old fashioned feel ... nice job', '2007-06-03 18:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3733129, 525413, 56254, '<td valign="top">wish the background were as saturated as teh foreground flowers ...</td>', 'wish the background were as saturated as teh foreground flowers ...', '2007-06-03 18:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3733130, 523264, 26464, '<td valign="top">looks like a sincere moment</td>', 'looks like a sincere moment', '2007-06-03 18:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3733131, 515629, 56254, '<td valign="top">background colors really hurt this image by competing for attention with the adorable child</td>', 'background colors really hurt this image by competing for attention with the adorable child', '2007-06-03 18:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3733132, 522761, 48860, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing that this was from the air show at jones beach?? I enjoyed it, definetly going next year, maybe by then i''ll get myself a lense to shoot pictures that close. =)</td>', 'I''m guessing that this was from the air show at jones beach?? I enjoyed it, definetly going next year, maybe by then i''ll get myself a lense to shoot pictures that close. =)', '2007-06-03 18:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3733133, 524857, 26464, '<td valign="top">great sharpness on subject...  8</td>', 'great sharpness on subject...  8', '2007-06-03 18:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3733141, 524863, 71664, '<td valign="top">Horizon is too centred and results in an image that is too static.  Try having the horizon higher or lower, and see which ofthose compositions works best.  IMO, if the horizon was higher, it would have been better because the rocks at the bottom are very interesting. 8</td>', 'Horizon is too centred and results in an image that is too static.  Try having the horizon higher or lower, and see which ofthose compositions works best.  IMO, if the horizon was higher, it would have been better because the rocks at the bottom are very interesting. 8', '2007-06-03 18:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3733144, 519264, 56254, '<td valign="top">a bit bright ... could use a slight boost in contrast also ...</td>', 'a bit bright ... could use a slight boost in contrast also ...', '2007-06-03 18:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3733148, 522972, 56254, '<td valign="top">wish you didn''t lose the brim of his hat in teh shadows</td>', 'wish you didn''t lose the brim of his hat in teh shadows', '2007-06-03 18:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3733154, 524584, 56254, '<td valign="top">blown flower hurts this one ... great sharpness on the bee ...</td>', 'blown flower hurts this one ... great sharpness on the bee ...', '2007-06-03 18:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3733163, 524272, 26464, '<td valign="top">wow.</td>', 'wow.', '2007-06-03 18:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3733164, 525193, 56254, '<td valign="top">personally, I don''t care for the border ... but the flower is gorgeous ... great color saturation ...</td>', 'personally, I don''t care for the border ... but the flower is gorgeous ... great color saturation ...', '2007-06-03 18:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3733178, 522511, 56254, '<td valign="top">is this -Bec- or makka?  I definitely recognize the model ...</td>', 'is this -Bec- or makka?  I definitely recognize the model ...', '2007-06-03 18:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3733182, 511796, 56254, '<td valign="top">not sharp enough ... wish the focus was on the dog</td>', 'not sharp enough ... wish the focus was on the dog', '2007-06-03 18:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
