(3736347, 522692, 42100, '<td valign="top">The shallow DOF of the rails beyond the station is very nice.  It looks really cool but still brings attention back to where it needs to be, at the real meat and potatoes of the photo.  I really enjoyed this one...top notch stuff!</td>', 'The shallow DOF of the rails beyond the station is very nice.  It looks really cool but still brings attention back to where it needs to be, at the real meat and potatoes of the photo.  I really enjoyed this one...top notch stuff!', '2007-06-04 10:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
