(3736682, 516840, 41794, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite shots in this challenge. I love the pose you captured and even without seeing his face I can imagine the awe and wonderment he is experiencing looking up at that huge tank.  I think the selective desat works well here as he doesn''t get lost in the photo. Well done!</td>', 'One of my favorite shots in this challenge. I love the pose you captured and even without seeing his face I can imagine the awe and wonderment he is experiencing looking up at that huge tank.  I think the selective desat works well here as he doesn''t get lost in the photo. Well done!', '2007-06-04 12:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
