(3737042, 524470, 41794, '<td valign="top">This definately has some potential. Maybe with some shadow/highlight could bring out their faces from the background a little more. I love how the little ones are peeking out over the edge.</td>', 'This definately has some potential. Maybe with some shadow/highlight could bring out their faces from the background a little more. I love how the little ones are peeking out over the edge.', '2007-06-04 13:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
