(3737048, 508919, 51793, '<td valign="top">Okay, you have a good start there but I think that the lighting is off a bit because it''s hitting the bowl and causing it to be blown out in the left bottom. Lighting on the ice cream is good but too much on the bowl. Also the background is too bright as well, with the advanced editing rules you should take advantage of the burn and doge tool and burn your background to really make the ice cream come alive. <br/> <br/>As far as the DOF (depth of focus) it looks as if the camera or you have focused on the ice cream (which is good) but it''s slightly off some.</td>', 'Okay, you have a good start there but I think that the lighting is off a bit because it''s hitting the bowl and causing it to be blown out in the left bottom. Lighting on the ice cream is good but too much on the bowl. Also the background is too bright as well, with the advanced editing rules you should take advantage of the burn and doge tool and burn your background to really make the ice cream come alive.  As far as the DOF (depth of focus) it looks as if the camera or you have focused on the ice cream (which is good) but it''s slightly off some.', '2007-06-04 13:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3737066, 523921, 51793, '<td valign="top">I think it has too much yellow in it and might have looked better in B&amp;W.</td>', 'I think it has too much yellow in it and might have looked better in B&W.', '2007-06-04 13:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3737069, 524748, 51793, '<td valign="top">Nice glow on the eyes, lighting is good, clearity is good. WTG</td>', 'Nice glow on the eyes, lighting is good, clearity is good. WTG', '2007-06-04 13:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3737072, 511638, 51793, '<td valign="top">okay you mind telling me how you did this?<br/> <br/>I love the lighting on the Dan-D and the background is perect.</td>', 'okay you mind telling me how you did this? I love the lighting on the Dan-D and the background is perect.', '2007-06-04 13:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
