(3737579, 522776, 57060, '<td valign="top">Nice sky and good processing. You''ve captured a good moment as well. To some degree I think the photo suffers from lack of a main subject. From the title it is about the girl leaping, but not many other things really emphasize this. The girl is in a good position on a lower third, but is midpoint along the horizontal. The very strong diagonals of the road and the ridge tend to play nicely off her shadow, but are oveshadowed by the huge and separated sky. Despite the frozen leap the image is really static. <br/> <br/>6<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'Nice sky and good processing. You''ve captured a good moment as well. To some degree I think the photo suffers from lack of a main subject. From the title it is about the girl leaping, but not many other things really emphasize this. The girl is in a good position on a lower third, but is midpoint along the horizontal. The very strong diagonals of the road and the ridge tend to play nicely off her shadow, but are oveshadowed by the huge and separated sky. Despite the frozen leap the image is really static.  6 Jack', '2007-06-04 15:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3737582, 524264, 42100, '<td valign="top">Dramatic angle, really emphasizes the line of the church and all its great details.  The warm light is also very nice.  Well done!</td>', 'Dramatic angle, really emphasizes the line of the church and all its great details.  The warm light is also very nice.  Well done!', '2007-06-04 15:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3737583, 525060, 18197, '<td valign="top">Wonderful subject. Nice composition. DOF does a nice job setting off the owl from its background. If the focus were sharper, and I could see the detail of the feathers, it would be a 9.</td>', 'Wonderful subject. Nice composition. DOF does a nice job setting off the owl from its background. If the focus were sharper, and I could see the detail of the feathers, it would be a 9.', '2007-06-04 15:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
