(3737994, 525271, 45829, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  I might want to clone out the intrusions (like the branch intercepting the colt''s hindquarters), soften the background, and bring down the exposure on the foreground grass.</td>', 'Very nice composition.  I might want to clone out the intrusions (like the branch intercepting the colt''s hindquarters), soften the background, and bring down the exposure on the foreground grass.', '2007-06-04 17:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
