(3738036, 507983, 65779, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been a lot stronger without the greenery on the left or burned out perhaps.  Or perhaps very narrow depth of field.</td>', 'I think this would have been a lot stronger without the greenery on the left or burned out perhaps.  Or perhaps very narrow depth of field.', '2007-06-04 17:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3738037, 522692, 57060, '<td valign="top">very nice, unfortunately I find the top half of the image too busy which competes with your main subject. a lower crop may have helped. I''d also like to some repetition with the lines of the legs - ideally a line that would line-up the white line, the tracks and the his leg would be best<br/> <br/>still, great vision, nice processing, just the right amount of ontrast<br/> <br/>very good shot<br/>7<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'very nice, unfortunately I find the top half of the image too busy which competes with your main subject. a lower crop may have helped. I''d also like to some repetition with the lines of the legs - ideally a line that would line-up the white line, the tracks and the his leg would be best still, great vision, nice processing, just the right amount of ontrast very good shot7 Jack', '2007-06-04 17:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
