(3738118, 524993, 32872, '<td valign="top">Intersting and ''colorful'' photo.  Love the crisp lines and angles...wish the midtones were stronger though, and I''m not too sure about the building on the lefthand side.</td>', 'Intersting and ''colorful'' photo.  Love the crisp lines and angles...wish the midtones were stronger though, and I''m not too sure about the building on the lefthand side.', '2007-06-04 18:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
