(3738131, 525415, 32872, '<td valign="top">She does indeed have beautiful eyes.  I think the camera focused on her clothing and not her eyes though, leaving her eyes out-of-focus slightly.  I like the pose and the headband at the top is a nice touch!</td>', 'She does indeed have beautiful eyes.  I think the camera focused on her clothing and not her eyes though, leaving her eyes out-of-focus slightly.  I like the pose and the headband at the top is a nice touch!', '2007-06-04 18:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
