(3738165, 519002, 57060, '<td valign="top">you''ve done a nice job with line leading from the LL c into the falls, but this is a pretty tough angle to sell a waterfall, just not much drama. it appears that your shutter speed is just a bit too fast to really blur the water so you''ve missed an opportunity for some drama there, finally you''ve got some sensor (or lens) dust in the water in a couple of spots. I like the title though!<br/> <br/>5<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'you''ve done a nice job with line leading from the LL c into the falls, but this is a pretty tough angle to sell a waterfall, just not much drama. it appears that your shutter speed is just a bit too fast to really blur the water so you''ve missed an opportunity for some drama there, finally you''ve got some sensor (or lens) dust in the water in a couple of spots. I like the title though! 5 Jack', '2007-06-04 18:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3738168, 522728, 32872, '<td valign="top">Very pretty and serene.  Wonderful gold tones on the lefthand side of the lake and I especially like the reflection on the nicely, lit boat.  I even noticed the birdhouse on the tree. :)<br/> <br/>I only wish there were something in that black spot on the bottom righthand side, maybe a fishing pole laying on the ground with a tackle box?  Lovely image though, and certainly looks like paradise to me!</td>', 'Very pretty and serene.  Wonderful gold tones on the lefthand side of the lake and I especially like the reflection on the nicely, lit boat.  I even noticed the birdhouse on the tree. :) I only wish there were something in that black spot on the bottom righthand side, maybe a fishing pole laying on the ground with a tackle box?  Lovely image though, and certainly looks like paradise to me!', '2007-06-04 18:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
