(3739224, 522527, 51793, '<td valign="top">Was she looking at the sunset??? With the orange tint to her face it looks like she might have been. Well that and your title. Also I think that when taking this picture a lot of people look at the subject and snap the shot. Some things we forget to do is look in the background, then we get it on screen and say OH MAN... Yeah, the stop sign. If you would have moved over a step or two to the right she would have blocked out the stop sign and this would have really been a great image. <br/> <br/>Good luck mate with your entry.</td>', 'Was she looking at the sunset??? With the orange tint to her face it looks like she might have been. Well that and your title. Also I think that when taking this picture a lot of people look at the subject and snap the shot. Some things we forget to do is look in the background, then we get it on screen and say OH MAN... Yeah, the stop sign. If you would have moved over a step or two to the right she would have blocked out the stop sign and this would have really been a great image.  Good luck mate with your entry.', '2007-06-04 22:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
