(3740793, 524262, 57060, '<td valign="top">colorful birds, nice timing to capture them interacting, nicely blurred background, and great focus on the eyes. ideally the rest of them would be sharper (stick, wing feathers, etc)<br/> <br/>6<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'colorful birds, nice timing to capture them interacting, nicely blurred background, and great focus on the eyes. ideally the rest of them would be sharper (stick, wing feathers, etc) 6 Jack', '2007-06-05 07:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3740801, 506612, 57060, '<td valign="top">great light and wonderful colors, i like the blue of the very dramatic sky and yellows  of the tree. there are many distractions though such as the road, the pole the house, the unfinished tree on the R, and the cluttered grass. the tree is also somewhat centrally located which makes the overall picture static. <br/> <br/>6<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'great light and wonderful colors, i like the blue of the very dramatic sky and yellows  of the tree. there are many distractions though such as the road, the pole the house, the unfinished tree on the R, and the cluttered grass. the tree is also somewhat centrally located which makes the overall picture static.  6 Jack', '2007-06-05 07:56:12.000000', NULL, 1);
