(3740806, 511770, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very cool - very misleading until you find the giraffe!</td>', 'Very cool - very misleading until you find the giraffe!', '2007-06-05 08:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3740807, 520038, 57060, '<td valign="top">nice lighting, with good facial detail having caught him between 3/4 and profile you still have nice highlights both his eyes and nearest cheek. great moment with his expression too. the bright area just past him on the L is competing with him though and I think the photo would be better if that were darkened just slightly<br/> <br/>7<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'nice lighting, with good facial detail having caught him between 3/4 and profile you still have nice highlights both his eyes and nearest cheek. great moment with his expression too. the bright area just past him on the L is competing with him though and I think the photo would be better if that were darkened just slightly 7 Jack', '2007-06-05 08:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3740808, 512322, 30982, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t seem as though those flowers would support him, does it?  Nice capture - lovely juxtaposition of the large insect and such delicate flowers.</td>', 'Doesn''t seem as though those flowers would support him, does it?  Nice capture - lovely juxtaposition of the large insect and such delicate flowers.', '2007-06-05 08:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3740809, 510550, 57060, '<td valign="top">beautiful motion blur of the water, with great colors, wonderful lines too from the water falling. unfortunately the bridge, road and lights are not working at all with the main subject, imo the photo would be better if you''d cropped  right along the top of the dam and pushed this just a bit more to the abstract. <br/> <br/>7<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'beautiful motion blur of the water, with great colors, wonderful lines too from the water falling. unfortunately the bridge, road and lights are not working at all with the main subject, imo the photo would be better if you''d cropped  right along the top of the dam and pushed this just a bit more to the abstract.  7 Jack', '2007-06-05 08:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3740812, 524391, 57060, '<td valign="top">i''m not sure what the blown area on the top or the bright spot above the plant adds to the picture, i really like the back lighting, they dynamic positioning of the plant<br/> <br/>6<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'i''m not sure what the blown area on the top or the bright spot above the plant adds to the picture, i really like the back lighting, they dynamic positioning of the plant 6 Jack', '2007-06-05 08:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3740814, 522940, 57060, '<td valign="top">overall looks really flat, great capture though<br/> <br/>5<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'overall looks really flat, great capture though 5 Jack', '2007-06-05 08:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3740817, 524549, 57060, '<td valign="top">overall yellow cast (WB?), the tv in the background doesn''t really work for me either. great lens though<br/> <br/>4<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'overall yellow cast (WB?), the tv in the background doesn''t really work for me either. great lens though 4 Jack', '2007-06-05 08:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3740822, 510093, 57060, '<td valign="top">nice lighting on the LTH. A lower crop to remove the competing branches may have helped, stepping to your R to take advantage of the darker background may have helped too. as it is the very bright area in the LR corner also competes with the LTH<br/> <br/>4<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'nice lighting on the LTH. A lower crop to remove the competing branches may have helped, stepping to your R to take advantage of the darker background may have helped too. as it is the very bright area in the LR corner also competes with the LTH 4 Jack', '2007-06-05 08:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3740828, 508065, 57060, '<td valign="top">very harsh lighting, but you''ve captured a dramatic sky. overall the image just appears static. personally i might have tried a bit lower pov, and a slowed shutter speed to get some motion blur in the clouds - that may have added some movement and made it more like your title<br/> <br/>5<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'very harsh lighting, but you''ve captured a dramatic sky. overall the image just appears static. personally i might have tried a bit lower pov, and a slowed shutter speed to get some motion blur in the clouds - that may have added some movement and made it more like your title 5 Jack', '2007-06-05 08:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3740829, 519490, 57060, '<td valign="top">nice color, he does have a mean beak! darkening the water may have helped the image a bit<br/> <br/>5<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'nice color, he does have a mean beak! darkening the water may have helped the image a bit 5 Jack', '2007-06-05 08:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
