(3742003, 521998, 53147, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful pic. Gave it a 9 and faved it on the first run through.Coming back to look at it again and the only reason I dont bump it to a 10 is because of the color leaking out onto the thumb and shirt. On a quick glance it isnt noticeable, but this is an image I want to hang out and look at, so as I scrutinize it becomes very evident. If you make this a print I hope you fix that. Overall though really well caught image.</td>', 'This is a wonderful pic. Gave it a 9 and faved it on the first run through.Coming back to look at it again and the only reason I dont bump it to a 10 is because of the color leaking out onto the thumb and shirt. On a quick glance it isnt noticeable, but this is an image I want to hang out and look at, so as I scrutinize it becomes very evident. If you make this a print I hope you fix that. Overall though really well caught image.', '2007-06-05 14:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
