(3744507, 525091, 76430, '<td valign="top">Now that is intensity.  Great high speed shot.  Good angle.  I''m sure the long lens was required for this shot.</td>', 'Now that is intensity.  Great high speed shot.  Good angle.  I''m sure the long lens was required for this shot.', '2007-06-06 00:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744522, 513100, 18197, '<td valign="top">This a scary-good, crazy-good photo. Great focus! You''ve made me empathize with your subject, like him even. Wonderful lighting. Great shadows. Unfortunately, my mother died of emphasima resulting from smoking.  So I am giving an 8-level photo a 2, because I can do NOTHING that makes smoking more desireable.</td>', 'This a scary-good, crazy-good photo. Great focus! You''ve made me empathize with your subject, like him even. Wonderful lighting. Great shadows. Unfortunately, my mother died of emphasima resulting from smoking.  So I am giving an 8-level photo a 2, because I can do NOTHING that makes smoking more desireable.', '2007-06-06 00:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744523, 524999, 42495, '<td valign="top">Really nice and the negative space works well.  The slight noise is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Really nice and the negative space works well.  The slight noise is a bit distracting.', '2007-06-06 00:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744532, 508919, 76430, '<td valign="top">It all seems pretty soft focus.  Maybe it''s because the strawberry/cherry is soft focus, but the other two seem that way also.  Maybe a bit smaller aperture.  Otherwise, nicely composed picture.</td>', 'It all seems pretty soft focus.  Maybe it''s because the strawberry/cherry is soft focus, but the other two seem that way also.  Maybe a bit smaller aperture.  Otherwise, nicely composed picture.', '2007-06-06 00:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744533, 517426, 18197, '<td valign="top">I fly about 200,000 miles a year. It is a well executed photo of a subject so common I have trouble remaining interested. Show me the mother of all thunderheads ... or show me raging forest fires from the air ... or show me glaciers descending the mountain slopes of Greenland or Iceland ... and I''m "all-in." The photos available to us from the air offer such a great opportunity for a new perspective. Let''s seek them out.</td>', 'I fly about 200,000 miles a year. It is a well executed photo of a subject so common I have trouble remaining interested. Show me the mother of all thunderheads ... or show me raging forest fires from the air ... or show me glaciers descending the mountain slopes of Greenland or Iceland ... and I''m "all-in." The photos available to us from the air offer such a great opportunity for a new perspective. Let''s seek them out.', '2007-06-06 01:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744550, 511033, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice product shot for a magazine ad, say, but the subject doesn''t interest me all that much. Why did you take and submit it? Why did it interest you? Is that interest shared by your audience here? Answering these questions may help you score well here.</td>', 'Nice product shot for a magazine ad, say, but the subject doesn''t interest me all that much. Why did you take and submit it? Why did it interest you? Is that interest shared by your audience here? Answering these questions may help you score well here.', '2007-06-06 01:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744590, 524550, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice photo but the level of post processing is too great for my taste. Maybe back off a little on the soft focus?</td>', 'Nice photo but the level of post processing is too great for my taste. Maybe back off a little on the soft focus?', '2007-06-06 01:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744950, 513134, 42495, '<td valign="top">Wow, what an expression!  You''ve perfectly captured a special moment.</td>', 'Wow, what an expression!  You''ve perfectly captured a special moment.', '2007-06-06 01:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
