(3745512, 520047, 70484, '<td valign="top">I love this capture! So unique. 9</td>', 'I love this capture! So unique. 9', '2007-06-06 04:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745513, 524524, 70484, '<td valign="top">Amazing IR capture! Very nice. 10</td>', 'Amazing IR capture! Very nice. 10', '2007-06-06 04:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745594, 522972, 8522, '<td valign="top">Every photographer''s portfolio should contain a roughly textured fisherman, and here''s yours! The PP is a little gratuitous for my taste though, especially in the texture of the clothes which distracts the eyes from the face. The crop could be much tighter, maybe to the bottom of the beard. The current crop takes attention away from the eyes, especially as the eyes aren''t using rule of thirds. Shame the circular logo on the cap has been chopped off... I would definitely have included that rather than the upper torso. The light in the background is not good at all and spoils the photo significantly. Other than that, interesting expression and composition.</td>', 'Every photographer''s portfolio should contain a roughly textured fisherman, and here''s yours! The PP is a little gratuitous for my taste though, especially in the texture of the clothes which distracts the eyes from the face. The crop could be much tighter, maybe to the bottom of the beard. The current crop takes attention away from the eyes, especially as the eyes aren''t using rule of thirds. Shame the circular logo on the cap has been chopped off... I would definitely have included that rather than the upper torso. The light in the background is not good at all and spoils the photo significantly. Other than that, interesting expression and composition.', '2007-06-06 06:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745598, 524748, 8522, '<td valign="top">Not sharp enough, the eyes in particular should be razor sharp. Perhaps some USM? The stripey light is a nice idea, but I''m not fond of the mask effect on the eyes. The forehead looks unnaturally smooth. The expression is not too inspired, particularly the mouth. The background looks a little too burnt in, a little texture would help. Composition feels a little unbalanced, perhaps rule of thirds could have helped?</td>', 'Not sharp enough, the eyes in particular should be razor sharp. Perhaps some USM? The stripey light is a nice idea, but I''m not fond of the mask effect on the eyes. The forehead looks unnaturally smooth. The expression is not too inspired, particularly the mouth. The background looks a little too burnt in, a little texture would help. Composition feels a little unbalanced, perhaps rule of thirds could have helped?', '2007-06-06 06:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745603, 525241, 8522, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the composition, why chop off a small part of the ear? I think more creative use of negative space could have transformed the photo, perhaps by including more space to the right and top. The shoulder works well in the composition tbough. The hair is a little messy, especially around her parting. The expression is not flattering, the crease between her eyes places a wall between her and the viewer. The mouth also seems to express displeasure. The face is slightly overexposed, especially the forehead and cheecks.</td>', 'Not sure about the composition, why chop off a small part of the ear? I think more creative use of negative space could have transformed the photo, perhaps by including more space to the right and top. The shoulder works well in the composition tbough. The hair is a little messy, especially around her parting. The expression is not flattering, the crease between her eyes places a wall between her and the viewer. The mouth also seems to express displeasure. The face is slightly overexposed, especially the forehead and cheecks.', '2007-06-06 06:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745608, 525180, 8522, '<td valign="top">Striking shot, shame about the overexposed clouds. There''s certainly enough shadow detail, I would definitely have brought the overall exposure down to keep detail in the highlights. Not sure about the placement of the horizon... it doesn''t look like it was a deliberate decision to place it just below centre. PP has enhanced the textures of what may have been an okay photograph to one with more impact.</td>', 'Striking shot, shame about the overexposed clouds. There''s certainly enough shadow detail, I would definitely have brought the overall exposure down to keep detail in the highlights. Not sure about the placement of the horizon... it doesn''t look like it was a deliberate decision to place it just below centre. PP has enhanced the textures of what may have been an okay photograph to one with more impact.', '2007-06-06 06:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745609, 507950, 8522, '<td valign="top">The world has many many sunset photos already, always ask yourself if you need to add another one! What do you want the viewer to focus on? Have you used any imagination with your composition? Putting something bang in the middle of the shot (horizon) is really only something you should do if you feel absolutely compelled to. Try to avoid it on the whole. The main problem here is the lack of interest in the shot to stop the eye going out of the frame.</td>', 'The world has many many sunset photos already, always ask yourself if you need to add another one! What do you want the viewer to focus on? Have you used any imagination with your composition? Putting something bang in the middle of the shot (horizon) is really only something you should do if you feel absolutely compelled to. Try to avoid it on the whole. The main problem here is the lack of interest in the shot to stop the eye going out of the frame.', '2007-06-06 06:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745612, 513372, 8522, '<td valign="top">I would have prefered the focus on the gambler rather than the fruit machine. The background is definitely too cluttered which spoils the composition. The crop could be much tighter by removing the bottom of the shot. The face of the gambler is currently too high in the frame. The expression isn''t amazing, this could be any fruit machine with any gambler at any point. The skill is to capture something a little unusual... a special moment.</td>', 'I would have prefered the focus on the gambler rather than the fruit machine. The background is definitely too cluttered which spoils the composition. The crop could be much tighter by removing the bottom of the shot. The face of the gambler is currently too high in the frame. The expression isn''t amazing, this could be any fruit machine with any gambler at any point. The skill is to capture something a little unusual... a special moment.', '2007-06-06 06:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745616, 507966, 8522, '<td valign="top">What are you trying to communicate with this photo? Is there a special mood or feeling here? It looks like a snapshot... did you deliberatly place the horizon in your shot? There''s a lot of featureless sky in the shot... was this deliberate? The photographer''s head is hunched down so you don''t really see it... was this deliberate? We get to see only one leg of the tripod... did you want that?</td>', 'What are you trying to communicate with this photo? Is there a special mood or feeling here? It looks like a snapshot... did you deliberatly place the horizon in your shot? There''s a lot of featureless sky in the shot... was this deliberate? The photographer''s head is hunched down so you don''t really see it... was this deliberate? We get to see only one leg of the tripod... did you want that?', '2007-06-06 06:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745619, 511482, 8522, '<td valign="top">Shame the grass around the feet is sho sharply in focus... traditionally it''s the face which is razor sharp, everything else should be blurry. What you''re communicating here is that you found the grass more interesting than the boy.</td>', 'Shame the grass around the feet is sho sharply in focus... traditionally it''s the face which is razor sharp, everything else should be blurry. What you''re communicating here is that you found the grass more interesting than the boy.', '2007-06-06 06:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745622, 525171, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice idea for the ooomposition... it doesn''t quite work for me though, everything is too small. There''s too much negative space that the bottom and right of the shot. The bird flying to the right on the right side of the photo means that the viewer''s eye is led out of the photo... you should usually aim to put animals and animals facing INTO the rest of the photo. Same with the boat.</td>', 'Nice idea for the ooomposition... it doesn''t quite work for me though, everything is too small. There''s too much negative space that the bottom and right of the shot. The bird flying to the right on the right side of the photo means that the viewer''s eye is led out of the photo... you should usually aim to put animals and animals facing INTO the rest of the photo. Same with the boat.', '2007-06-06 06:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745625, 525413, 8522, '<td valign="top">The wonky horizon really puts me off. Shot looks like it needs some colour balancing. Might work better if the background was more out of focus.</td>', 'The wonky horizon really puts me off. Shot looks like it needs some colour balancing. Might work better if the background was more out of focus.', '2007-06-06 06:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745628, 522412, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice study of shapes and textures, but the composition isn''t strong enough. What is the point of focus? The trick is to lead the viewer''s eye and give it flow. Here, the eye is led out of the shot in several places... it''s not clear what is really important and why we should spend a while looking at it. What does it communicate?</td>', 'Nice study of shapes and textures, but the composition isn''t strong enough. What is the point of focus? The trick is to lead the viewer''s eye and give it flow. Here, the eye is led out of the shot in several places... it''s not clear what is really important and why we should spend a while looking at it. What does it communicate?', '2007-06-06 06:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745630, 521543, 8522, '<td valign="top">The bottom of the shot and the bird is great! The white sky is awful. The composition feels bottom heavy to me. I wish the bird was bigger... perhaps a tighter crop? Not sure about the oof grain on the right.</td>', 'The bottom of the shot and the bird is great! The white sky is awful. The composition feels bottom heavy to me. I wish the bird was bigger... perhaps a tighter crop? Not sure about the oof grain on the right.', '2007-06-06 06:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745632, 516172, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice mood, not sure about the composition though. What''s with all the negative space on the left? Is Dave looking at Jake who''s looking at the Tele? Perhaps you could have made a little more of that... Any reason for looking down on this scene? I may have prefered it with you on their level. I do like the negative space above them though, the texture of the wall is great. I like the feet, but maybe it could have been stronger if they both had bare feet?</td>', 'Nice mood, not sure about the composition though. What''s with all the negative space on the left? Is Dave looking at Jake who''s looking at the Tele? Perhaps you could have made a little more of that... Any reason for looking down on this scene? I may have prefered it with you on their level. I do like the negative space above them though, the texture of the wall is great. I like the feet, but maybe it could have been stronger if they both had bare feet?', '2007-06-06 06:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745636, 522882, 8522, '<td valign="top">It''s a boat... and a sunset. Not sure really what else to say! Perhaps you could have played with the baot''s name in some way? Here it just looks like it''s the name of the boat and the name of the photo. What are you trying to communicate with this photo? Not sure about the placement of the sun... any reason why you placed it where it is in the shot? The sky is a bit featureless for the amount of prominence it has here.</td>', 'It''s a boat... and a sunset. Not sure really what else to say! Perhaps you could have played with the baot''s name in some way? Here it just looks like it''s the name of the boat and the name of the photo. What are you trying to communicate with this photo? Not sure about the placement of the sun... any reason why you placed it where it is in the shot? The sky is a bit featureless for the amount of prominence it has here.', '2007-06-06 06:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745639, 519068, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice macro lens, and you have good dof field here. Other than that, it''s just a shot of a butterfly, not particularly imaginatively composed/cropped. The background doesn''t work well... perhaps if you''d got into a better angle, you could have avoided the diagonal line which cuts through the wings. What is the point of focus here? It looks like you haven''t really thought about it... just fitting the whole butterfly into the frame is not the way forwards.</td>', 'Nice macro lens, and you have good dof field here. Other than that, it''s just a shot of a butterfly, not particularly imaginatively composed/cropped. The background doesn''t work well... perhaps if you''d got into a better angle, you could have avoided the diagonal line which cuts through the wings. What is the point of focus here? It looks like you haven''t really thought about it... just fitting the whole butterfly into the frame is not the way forwards.', '2007-06-06 06:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745645, 522712, 57060, '<td valign="top">i assume you mean the three men framed which was good timing and a good eye. the overall shot suffers due to the harsh light and the picture just is too busy. even with that the lines help to focus us towards the men, but imo just not enough. 5<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'i assume you mean the three men framed which was good timing and a good eye. the overall shot suffers due to the harsh light and the picture just is too busy. even with that the lines help to focus us towards the men, but imo just not enough. 5 Jack', '2007-06-06 07:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745649, 512286, 57060, '<td valign="top">interesting character you''ve got here, with a good expression too. picture looks a bit flat to me, a bit of vignetting may have helped block out the distractions on the L and R<br/> <br/>6<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'interesting character you''ve got here, with a good expression too. picture looks a bit flat to me, a bit of vignetting may have helped block out the distractions on the L and R 6 Jack', '2007-06-06 07:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745652, 524993, 57060, '<td valign="top">nice colors of sky contrasted against the colors of the buildings, beyond that though it gets cluttered up quickly. the wall on the L and the light in the upper R are distracting. better overall quality of light would help too<br/> <br/>6<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'nice colors of sky contrasted against the colors of the buildings, beyond that though it gets cluttered up quickly. the wall on the L and the light in the upper R are distracting. better overall quality of light would help too 6 Jack', '2007-06-06 07:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745661, 511316, 57060, '<td valign="top">nice rgb type shot, the colors are nice and separated, and you''ve saturated them nicely too. you''ve positioned the ground/sky on a 1/3 and the oven is at a good spot from a compositional standpoint. I think the white cliff behind the oven tends to attract attention and even though it complements the sky is not part of your main subject. perhaps some dodging and burning to highlight the lines on the grass pointing to the oven may help, otherwise it tends to be static (another idea may have been to use a slower shutter and get some motion blur in the clouds)<br/> <br/>6<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'nice rgb type shot, the colors are nice and separated, and you''ve saturated them nicely too. you''ve positioned the ground/sky on a 1/3 and the oven is at a good spot from a compositional standpoint. I think the white cliff behind the oven tends to attract attention and even though it complements the sky is not part of your main subject. perhaps some dodging and burning to highlight the lines on the grass pointing to the oven may help, otherwise it tends to be static (another idea may have been to use a slower shutter and get some motion blur in the clouds) 6 Jack', '2007-06-06 07:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745662, 521419, 57060, '<td valign="top">nice uv effect on the shoes, compositionally it works too, i like the frame<br/> <br/>nice shot<br/> <br/>7<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'nice uv effect on the shoes, compositionally it works too, i like the frame nice shot 7 Jack', '2007-06-06 07:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745671, 524996, 57060, '<td valign="top">i like the perspective and sense of size with the kids dwarfed by the falls. the lighting is pretty harsh and the specular lights on the stream can be distracting. the biggest problem, imo, it the crop. way too much on the bushes which honestly are not interesting and only take away from the real subject<br/> <br/>5<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'i like the perspective and sense of size with the kids dwarfed by the falls. the lighting is pretty harsh and the specular lights on the stream can be distracting. the biggest problem, imo, it the crop. way too much on the bushes which honestly are not interesting and only take away from the real subject 5 Jack', '2007-06-06 07:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745686, 513337, 57060, '<td valign="top">nice shot, good composition, the reds just seem a bit over saturated, the shadows add nicely to the depth of the picture. the fence in the background unfortunately runs just at her head level and is a little distracting. overall nice shot, to me the biggest problem are the reds just turn into red blobs<br/> <br/>6<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'nice shot, good composition, the reds just seem a bit over saturated, the shadows add nicely to the depth of the picture. the fence in the background unfortunately runs just at her head level and is a little distracting. overall nice shot, to me the biggest problem are the reds just turn into red blobs 6 Jack', '2007-06-06 07:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745691, 520047, 57060, '<td valign="top">cute picture of little horse, nice sharpness and lighting<br/> <br/>6<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'cute picture of little horse, nice sharpness and lighting 6 Jack', '2007-06-06 07:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745700, 524759, 57060, '<td valign="top">interesting shot, i like the man looking out of frame, the pole with the wires et al makes your point about the electricity, but imo the bright sky is very distracting and pulls the eye up and out fo the photo. i think you may have been able to crop down below the cylinder, avoided the sky and still made your point. i do like the processing here too<br/> <br/>6<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'interesting shot, i like the man looking out of frame, the pole with the wires et al makes your point about the electricity, but imo the bright sky is very distracting and pulls the eye up and out fo the photo. i think you may have been able to crop down below the cylinder, avoided the sky and still made your point. i do like the processing here too 6 Jack', '2007-06-06 07:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745706, 520247, 57060, '<td valign="top">i believe that is really tough to make this type of subject very interesting, the lighting here looks good, but you''ve blurred the bark a bit, otherwise there really isn''t too much to look at<br/> <br/>4<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'i believe that is really tough to make this type of subject very interesting, the lighting here looks good, but you''ve blurred the bark a bit, otherwise there really isn''t too much to look at 4 Jack', '2007-06-06 07:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745711, 507455, 57060, '<td valign="top">really interesting shot, i like the balance of bright light on the R with the larger neg space on the L and the blurred area really adds a dynamic feel. one of my favorites from the challenge<br/> <br/>great shot, 8<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'really interesting shot, i like the balance of bright light on the R with the larger neg space on the L and the blurred area really adds a dynamic feel. one of my favorites from the challenge great shot, 8 Jack', '2007-06-06 07:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745717, 507447, 57060, '<td valign="top">i really like lensbabys, but as i understand them (don''t have one myself) the selective focus should be used to highlight your main subject. it appears to me the area of focus is off the path and to the L. Good try, see grigrigirl (?sp) for some spectacular lensbaby shots<br/> <br/>5<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'i really like lensbabys, but as i understand them (don''t have one myself) the selective focus should be used to highlight your main subject. it appears to me the area of focus is off the path and to the L. Good try, see grigrigirl (?sp) for some spectacular lensbaby shots 5 Jack', '2007-06-06 07:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745721, 513224, 57060, '<td valign="top">good moment, not the best lighting and kinda busy<br/> <br/>6<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'good moment, not the best lighting and kinda busy 6 Jack', '2007-06-06 07:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745724, 519617, 57060, '<td valign="top">nice delicate touch here with lighting, colors, processing, composition<br/> <br/>6<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'nice delicate touch here with lighting, colors, processing, composition 6 Jack', '2007-06-06 07:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745728, 513280, 57060, '<td valign="top">nice shot, good processing. the light coming out of his head is a bit unfortunate. <br/> <br/>6<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'nice shot, good processing. the light coming out of his head is a bit unfortunate.  6 Jack', '2007-06-06 07:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745729, 524441, 57060, '<td valign="top">very nice lighting and moment<br/> <br/>6<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'very nice lighting and moment 6 Jack', '2007-06-06 07:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745734, 521396, 57060, '<td valign="top">i like the repeating shapes of the rocks and the clouds in the sky, perhaps darkening and a bit of D&amp;B on them may have made the image pop a bit<br/> <br/>6<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'i like the repeating shapes of the rocks and the clouds in the sky, perhaps darkening and a bit of D&B on them may have made the image pop a bit 6 Jack', '2007-06-06 07:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745738, 514039, 57060, '<td valign="top">really like the colors and lighting here, nicely composed with the soft, blurred background lights and colors that compliment the flowers<br/> <br/>7<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'really like the colors and lighting here, nicely composed with the soft, blurred background lights and colors that compliment the flowers 7 Jack', '2007-06-06 07:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745746, 519150, 57060, '<td valign="top">i like the multiple repeating shapes of triangles in the mountains, clouds, trees, and the rock. plus the overall wedge of the sky and shoreline. really very nice composition, i just think this probably needs a bit more dramatic light or processing to really make it stand out<br/> <br/>7<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'i like the multiple repeating shapes of triangles in the mountains, clouds, trees, and the rock. plus the overall wedge of the sky and shoreline. really very nice composition, i just think this probably needs a bit more dramatic light or processing to really make it stand out 7 Jack', '2007-06-06 07:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745749, 520859, 57060, '<td valign="top">imo definitely the best bug/flower shot (of many!) in the challenge. great colors and clarity<br/> <br/>8<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'imo definitely the best bug/flower shot (of many!) in the challenge. great colors and clarity 8 Jack', '2007-06-06 07:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745752, 513134, 57060, '<td valign="top">incredible moment, her eyes look like two more balloons. the colors are fantastic but i find (at least on my monitor) a bit of blue color cast to her face which is not that appealing, perhaps a bit of fill on her would have helped warm it a bit. i do think with that it would have ribboned - still may, good luck<br/> <br/>8<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'incredible moment, her eyes look like two more balloons. the colors are fantastic but i find (at least on my monitor) a bit of blue color cast to her face which is not that appealing, perhaps a bit of fill on her would have helped warm it a bit. i do think with that it would have ribboned - still may, good luck 8 Jack', '2007-06-06 07:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745755, 522686, 57060, '<td valign="top">ducks are a bit blurry due to motion and to a looking through a window? i like this and personally think pushing the abstract side may have been really good<br/> <br/>6<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'ducks are a bit blurry due to motion and to a looking through a window? i like this and personally think pushing the abstract side may have been really good 6 Jack', '2007-06-06 07:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745758, 515848, 57060, '<td valign="top">great lighting and colors, i find the composition just a bit static though with the foreground separated from the color and light with a strong horizontal line which for me breaks the picture into two parts<br/> <br/>7<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'great lighting and colors, i find the composition just a bit static though with the foreground separated from the color and light with a strong horizontal line which for me breaks the picture into two parts 7 Jack', '2007-06-06 07:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745789, 510922, 35602, '<td valign="top">Nice message, but as a photo I think that the technique of oof for the figure will bring your score down.</td>', 'Nice message, but as a photo I think that the technique of oof for the figure will bring your score down.', '2007-06-06 08:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745792, 523086, 35602, '<td valign="top">Nice outline light on the leaves.</td>', 'Nice outline light on the leaves.', '2007-06-06 08:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745795, 525435, 35602, '<td valign="top">Didn''t think this could look good as b&amp;w, but it really does.  Shows the tones and contrasts much better.  Really like what you did with light as well.</td>', 'Didn''t think this could look good as b&w, but it really does.  Shows the tones and contrasts much better.  Really like what you did with light as well.', '2007-06-06 08:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745799, 522972, 35602, '<td valign="top">Great portrait.  The eyes could have been a bit lighter, though.  Maybe a bit more dodging, or layering with an exposure layer to brighten the eyes a little.  7</td>', 'Great portrait.  The eyes could have been a bit lighter, though.  Maybe a bit more dodging, or layering with an exposure layer to brighten the eyes a little.  7', '2007-06-06 08:12:13.000000', NULL, 1);
