(3745884, 525125, 67145, '<td valign="top">wow .. this is awesome .. a wonderful capture of an incredible sea and the person on the raft thingy (sorry, but i dont know wot its called) .. the yellow splash of colour is excellent ... he looks like he''s just about to be eaten up .. =10</td>', 'wow .. this is awesome .. a wonderful capture of an incredible sea and the person on the raft thingy (sorry, but i dont know wot its called) .. the yellow splash of colour is excellent ... he looks like he''s just about to be eaten up .. =10', '2007-06-06 08:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745888, 524441, 67145, '<td valign="top">totally awesome .. the way the dress follows the lines of her body if she wasnt pregnant and her swollen belly sort''v emerging from it is wonderful .. the skin, the hands, the pose, the expressions totally beautiful .. =10</td>', 'totally awesome .. the way the dress follows the lines of her body if she wasnt pregnant and her swollen belly sort''v emerging from it is wonderful .. the skin, the hands, the pose, the expressions totally beautiful .. =10', '2007-06-06 08:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745891, 519243, 67145, '<td valign="top">OMG .. incredible .. the boat, the bird, the colours, the composition .. the yeloow waves merging with the more orange tone .. excellent .. =10</td>', 'OMG .. incredible .. the boat, the bird, the colours, the composition .. the yeloow waves merging with the more orange tone .. excellent .. =10', '2007-06-06 08:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745896, 525175, 19978, '<td valign="top">Won''t appeal to everyone but I think it''s spectacular. Her nonchalant, indifferent pose and expression are perfectly matched to the grainy textures and stark BW appearance. The way her hair seems to blend into the dark negative space at left is perfect. This one goes directly into the faves and I''ll be back to see who pulled this off after the challenge. Congrats!</td>', 'Won''t appeal to everyone but I think it''s spectacular. Her nonchalant, indifferent pose and expression are perfectly matched to the grainy textures and stark BW appearance. The way her hair seems to blend into the dark negative space at left is perfect. This one goes directly into the faves and I''ll be back to see who pulled this off after the challenge. Congrats!', '2007-06-06 08:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745897, 524235, 67145, '<td valign="top">love this image ... the grungy look and the entire composition .. excellent .. =10</td>', 'love this image ... the grungy look and the entire composition .. excellent .. =10', '2007-06-06 08:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745898, 525217, 19978, '<td valign="top">Unbelievable! Are you serious? If this was staged, my hat is off. If it wasn''t, you have my unending respect. I''ll be back after voting to find out how you pulled this off. Creativity 10. Wow value 10. Overall appeal 10.</td>', 'Unbelievable! Are you serious? If this was staged, my hat is off. If it wasn''t, you have my unending respect. I''ll be back after voting to find out how you pulled this off. Creativity 10. Wow value 10. Overall appeal 10.', '2007-06-06 08:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745899, 525368, 19978, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait. Beautiful sense of how to compose/crop the image. Her hair frames herself perfectly, which is itself framed by the boundaries of the shot. Her expression is mildly amused and full of intrigue. And oh yes, the eyes! Wow.</td>', 'Lovely portrait. Beautiful sense of how to compose/crop the image. Her hair frames herself perfectly, which is itself framed by the boundaries of the shot. Her expression is mildly amused and full of intrigue. And oh yes, the eyes! Wow.', '2007-06-06 08:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745902, 512002, 19978, '<td valign="top">Excellent! I love the tones and contrast you''ve captured in the sky. Great job on managing the varying light levels from the city lights too. 8.</td>', 'Excellent! I love the tones and contrast you''ve captured in the sky. Great job on managing the varying light levels from the city lights too. 8.', '2007-06-06 08:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
