(3746325, 521998, 70000, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing photograph, there is an orange hightlight around the child''s thumb that messes it up though. selective desat like this is really hard, I would try toning down the yellow a bit and them maybe the edges wont be so harsh. awesome capture though</td>', 'This is an amazing photograph, there is an orange hightlight around the child''s thumb that messes it up though. selective desat like this is really hard, I would try toning down the yellow a bit and them maybe the edges wont be so harsh. awesome capture though', '2007-06-06 10:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3746330, 524255, 70000, '<td valign="top">This is such a cute photo and I love the scale but the focus and highlights need some work. I would try running tis through USM and just playing with the different percentages and radiuses until it gets the sharpness you want. Also the whole photo can be darker with a little bit more contrast.</td>', 'This is such a cute photo and I love the scale but the focus and highlights need some work. I would try running tis through USM and just playing with the different percentages and radiuses until it gets the sharpness you want. Also the whole photo can be darker with a little bit more contrast.', '2007-06-06 10:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3746348, 523200, 52939, '<td valign="top">I really like the tones on this one.   I would like if the second tree didn''t run into the darkness in the field so much, but it may also be my monitor... Sharp.</td>', 'I really like the tones on this one.   I would like if the second tree didn''t run into the darkness in the field so much, but it may also be my monitor... Sharp.', '2007-06-06 10:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
