(3746844, 523000, 208, '<td valign="top">That title is sneaky - made me look to see what the heck you were talking about. You might have a little too much DOF here; I think I''d like more of the flower in focus. The flower could be brighter, too, and the background on the right is distracting, even while out of focus. Your subject, though, is interesting, and I like the shapes - especially the titular droplet contrasting with all the angles elsewhere.</td>', 'That title is sneaky - made me look to see what the heck you were talking about. You might have a little too much DOF here; I think I''d like more of the flower in focus. The flower could be brighter, too, and the background on the right is distracting, even while out of focus. Your subject, though, is interesting, and I like the shapes - especially the titular droplet contrasting with all the angles elsewhere.', '2007-06-06 13:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3746877, 511167, 61559, '<td valign="top">Cool! I like the way they seem generally concerned about their patient!</td>', 'Cool! I like the way they seem generally concerned about their patient!', '2007-06-06 13:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3746887, 524715, 61559, '<td valign="top">Two things that would boost your scores: I realize it''s awfully hard to get spiders to pose, but a more head-on view would help. Also, the colors are a bit dull. If you boost your Saturation in PS, I think it would help this image a LOT.</td>', 'Two things that would boost your scores: I realize it''s awfully hard to get spiders to pose, but a more head-on view would help. Also, the colors are a bit dull. If you boost your Saturation in PS, I think it would help this image a LOT.', '2007-06-06 13:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3746889, 523436, 61559, '<td valign="top">Cool! Great feel! 8.</td>', 'Cool! Great feel! 8.', '2007-06-06 13:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3746907, 522686, 61559, '<td valign="top">Things that would help this score better: Better lighting. The gray overcast day certainly didn''t do these guy colors any favors. Better lighting would also improve your depth of field and allow you to get a faster shutter speed for stopping the motion. IMO, motion should be all or nothing. Give it lots of motion or make it super crisp.</td>', 'Things that would help this score better: Better lighting. The gray overcast day certainly didn''t do these guy colors any favors. Better lighting would also improve your depth of field and allow you to get a faster shutter speed for stopping the motion. IMO, motion should be all or nothing. Give it lots of motion or make it super crisp.', '2007-06-06 13:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3747116, 525426, 52939, '<td valign="top">An impressive structure... May I suggest maybe bumping the contrast up a bit.? seems alittle on the light side.  Good luck.</td>', 'An impressive structure... May I suggest maybe bumping the contrast up a bit.? seems alittle on the light side.  Good luck.', '2007-06-06 14:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3747121, 510634, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot... I''m not completely convinced by the composition, especially the section of wall down the left hand edge of the shot. The textures are great, and the man adds interest and mood. I think what I like least about it is the patch of wall which is much lighter to the right of the man. The eye is usually drawn to the lightest part of a photo, which makes it hard to know where to settle on this photo.</td>', 'Interesting shot... I''m not completely convinced by the composition, especially the section of wall down the left hand edge of the shot. The textures are great, and the man adds interest and mood. I think what I like least about it is the patch of wall which is much lighter to the right of the man. The eye is usually drawn to the lightest part of a photo, which makes it hard to know where to settle on this photo.', '2007-06-06 14:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3747138, 524992, 8522, '<td valign="top">A nice shot for someone starting out. To make this really stand out, the shot needs to be very sharp somewhere in the shot. The bottom of the shot looks like it should be cropped out, perhaps a tighter crop in general on the flower would work better while keeping the negative space on the right. The greens work well, effective dof. In general though, a flower shot has to be amazing to really stand out in a DPC challenge, there are a lot of flower shots on this site!</td>', 'A nice shot for someone starting out. To make this really stand out, the shot needs to be very sharp somewhere in the shot. The bottom of the shot looks like it should be cropped out, perhaps a tighter crop in general on the flower would work better while keeping the negative space on the right. The greens work well, effective dof. In general though, a flower shot has to be amazing to really stand out in a DPC challenge, there are a lot of flower shots on this site!', '2007-06-06 14:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3747157, 523311, 8522, '<td valign="top">The first thing I notice about this photo is how much I really don''t like the border. If I notice the border more than the photo, I''d say it''s not a great border. DOF works well here, with an interesting background. Butterfly is nice and sharp. Not convinced by the composition/crop though, what is the most important part of the shot that you want people to look at? How are you communicating that?</td>', 'The first thing I notice about this photo is how much I really don''t like the border. If I notice the border more than the photo, I''d say it''s not a great border. DOF works well here, with an interesting background. Butterfly is nice and sharp. Not convinced by the composition/crop though, what is the most important part of the shot that you want people to look at? How are you communicating that?', '2007-06-06 14:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3747174, 524684, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wow, beautiful shot! The sky really makes this great, the ultra wide angle worked really well here. Lovely colours. What a location!</td>', 'Wow, beautiful shot! The sky really makes this great, the ultra wide angle worked really well here. Lovely colours. What a location!', '2007-06-06 14:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3747188, 518813, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great idea, would have worked much better for me if the feet were more covered with sand leaving the toes looking a bit more abstract. If well excecuted, could be a really striking graphic design image.</td>', 'Great idea, would have worked much better for me if the feet were more covered with sand leaving the toes looking a bit more abstract. If well excecuted, could be a really striking graphic design image.', '2007-06-06 14:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3747244, 507665, 8522, '<td valign="top">Background editing has left a lot of ugly looking patches which can be seen depending on the monitor. Would look a lot better with an effective even background anyway, rather than one which is 100% white. The clothes work well here, it''s a shame the subject looks so unhappy. Hands are a really important part of any portrait if they''re in the shot, it''s a shame they''re half hidden here. Not sure about the composition, any special reason here not to use rule of thirds? Otherwise the negative space feels unbalanced.</td>', 'Background editing has left a lot of ugly looking patches which can be seen depending on the monitor. Would look a lot better with an effective even background anyway, rather than one which is 100% white. The clothes work well here, it''s a shame the subject looks so unhappy. Hands are a really important part of any portrait if they''re in the shot, it''s a shame they''re half hidden here. Not sure about the composition, any special reason here not to use rule of thirds? Otherwise the negative space feels unbalanced.', '2007-06-06 14:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3747344, 507099, 75648, '<td valign="top">just a wonderful capture it belongs in a nature book</td>', 'just a wonderful capture it belongs in a nature book', '2007-06-06 14:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
