(3748785, 525036, 57060, '<td valign="top">really like the short focal length, the colors are vibrant, the tradition 1/3 positioning of subjects are nice, I do find the spacing between the barn and the farmer a bit much, and ideally the farmer''s head would not overlie the horizon. perhaps a bit lower pov would have helped too<br/> <br/>6<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'really like the short focal length, the colors are vibrant, the tradition 1/3 positioning of subjects are nice, I do find the spacing between the barn and the farmer a bit much, and ideally the farmer''s head would not overlie the horizon. perhaps a bit lower pov would have helped too 6 Jack', '2007-06-06 19:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3748788, 524990, 57060, '<td valign="top">i really like the glowing yellow set on a dark background, usually with a tint of green. you have done that well, it does appear that you have a bit of halo around the stem where you dodged that area, I''m also not too crazy about the competing yellow area in the LL corner. personally i think this would be better without the bee, but maybe not, i imagine you tried a variation of this with out it and chose this one. i''m sure you''ll get a few comments about the border too, but i like it.<br/> <br/>6<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'i really like the glowing yellow set on a dark background, usually with a tint of green. you have done that well, it does appear that you have a bit of halo around the stem where you dodged that area, I''m also not too crazy about the competing yellow area in the LL corner. personally i think this would be better without the bee, but maybe not, i imagine you tried a variation of this with out it and chose this one. i''m sure you''ll get a few comments about the border too, but i like it. 6 Jack', '2007-06-06 19:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
