(3749980, 523332, 19708, '<td valign="top">This may have been more effective in b&amp;w, as the pink tones seem very unnatural.</td>', 'This may have been more effective in b&w, as the pink tones seem very unnatural.', '2007-06-07 00:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3749984, 511033, 19708, '<td valign="top">The saturation/levels of the cyan in the sky is bit harsh and fights for attention here.</td>', 'The saturation/levels of the cyan in the sky is bit harsh and fights for attention here.', '2007-06-07 00:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3749990, 525132, 19708, '<td valign="top">Most unusual landscape - almost looks like a miniature.</td>', 'Most unusual landscape - almost looks like a miniature.', '2007-06-07 00:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3749992, 524391, 19708, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what to think / suggest. If the sun flare in the upper right is removed, it''s bland, but as it is now, seems to fight for attention.</td>', 'I don''t know what to think / suggest. If the sun flare in the upper right is removed, it''s bland, but as it is now, seems to fight for attention.', '2007-06-07 00:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3749998, 523919, 19708, '<td valign="top">I enjoy watching the Gorillas at the San Diego Zoo, as they strike such interesting poses, much like what you have here. Shame the concrete has such strong presence in this shot, and a tighter crop may have worked better.</td>', 'I enjoy watching the Gorillas at the San Diego Zoo, as they strike such interesting poses, much like what you have here. Shame the concrete has such strong presence in this shot, and a tighter crop may have worked better.', '2007-06-07 00:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750003, 522503, 19708, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape/seascape. Seems a bit over-exposed though. Deep, rich tones work so much better to grab the emotions.</td>', 'Nice landscape/seascape. Seems a bit over-exposed though. Deep, rich tones work so much better to grab the emotions.', '2007-06-07 01:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750006, 524990, 19708, '<td valign="top">Not a big fan of how wide the yellow border is here, and overall seems to have too much Gaussian blur? applied.</td>', 'Not a big fan of how wide the yellow border is here, and overall seems to have too much Gaussian blur? applied.', '2007-06-07 01:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750008, 511482, 19708, '<td valign="top">Cute shot - try cropping so he isn''t so dead-center in the frame. Just an suggestion...</td>', 'Cute shot - try cropping so he isn''t so dead-center in the frame. Just an suggestion...', '2007-06-07 01:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750016, 524969, 19708, '<td valign="top">Reds are tough aren''t they. I''m not sure the sky as a background works real well. Most often yellowish/greens/plants/foliage, in an out of focus background compliment a flower like this better.</td>', 'Reds are tough aren''t they. I''m not sure the sky as a background works real well. Most often yellowish/greens/plants/foliage, in an out of focus background compliment a flower like this better.', '2007-06-07 01:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750020, 525112, 19708, '<td valign="top">I think a bit too soft though. Not much really in focus/sharp here - the head being clearer would have been a plus.</td>', 'I think a bit too soft though. Not much really in focus/sharp here - the head being clearer would have been a plus.', '2007-06-07 01:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750023, 524085, 19708, '<td valign="top">Nice moment caught here. The foreground is a bit over-exposed, but an easy fix.</td>', 'Nice moment caught here. The foreground is a bit over-exposed, but an easy fix.', '2007-06-07 01:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750025, 524686, 19708, '<td valign="top">Magical. Beautiful. Well done!</td>', 'Magical. Beautiful. Well done!', '2007-06-07 01:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750027, 523311, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great macro, but overall seems far too harsh/bright, making it hard to look at for any length of time.</td>', 'Great macro, but overall seems far too harsh/bright, making it hard to look at for any length of time.', '2007-06-07 01:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750029, 525175, 19708, '<td valign="top">Now this is unique! Kudos for going out on a limb, and somehow can see this is commercial applications.</td>', 'Now this is unique! Kudos for going out on a limb, and somehow can see this is commercial applications.', '2007-06-07 01:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750032, 524644, 19708, '<td valign="top">Well done. I can never get one right. As a suggestion, watch out for dead-center crops.</td>', 'Well done. I can never get one right. As a suggestion, watch out for dead-center crops.', '2007-06-07 01:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750035, 524400, 19708, '<td valign="top">Nice job on getting the lighting right on this!</td>', 'Nice job on getting the lighting right on this!', '2007-06-07 01:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750044, 524660, 19708, '<td valign="top">A few notes: Watch out for a dead-center crop. The overall feel on this is too harsh and contrast is too high. I''m not sure what was done in post-processing, but the erratic soft focus/blur around different parts of the  lion is kinda odd.</td>', 'A few notes: Watch out for a dead-center crop. The overall feel on this is too harsh and contrast is too high. I''m not sure what was done in post-processing, but the erratic soft focus/blur around different parts of the  lion is kinda odd.', '2007-06-07 01:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750045, 524880, 19708, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. A scene that greeting cards are made of.</td>', 'Beautiful. A scene that greeting cards are made of.', '2007-06-07 01:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750046, 509809, 19708, '<td valign="top">Quite the fire in the sky look. Nice refection here.</td>', 'Quite the fire in the sky look. Nice refection here.', '2007-06-07 01:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750052, 508207, 19708, '<td valign="top">I''m interested to see the technicals on this one, such as exposure length and what was used as the lighting source.</td>', 'I''m interested to see the technicals on this one, such as exposure length and what was used as the lighting source.', '2007-06-07 01:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750054, 521291, 19708, '<td valign="top">Veyr pretty and a very classic shot done well. Maybe -1/2 EV would richen this a bit as well.</td>', 'Veyr pretty and a very classic shot done well. Maybe -1/2 EV would richen this a bit as well.', '2007-06-07 01:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750055, 520986, 19708, '<td valign="top">Well seen and composed - beautiful shot.</td>', 'Well seen and composed - beautiful shot.', '2007-06-07 01:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750056, 524255, 19708, '<td valign="top">Cute - made me smile.</td>', 'Cute - made me smile.', '2007-06-07 01:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750059, 522604, 19708, '<td valign="top">Wow - where can I get a ladder like yours? Often airplane shots never end up right, but this one is a keeper.</td>', 'Wow - where can I get a ladder like yours? Often airplane shots never end up right, but this one is a keeper.', '2007-06-07 01:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750063, 510175, 19708, '<td valign="top">Ouch! This is very harsh and high in contrast, making it hard to look at for any length of time.</td>', 'Ouch! This is very harsh and high in contrast, making it hard to look at for any length of time.', '2007-06-07 01:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750064, 508201, 19708, '<td valign="top">Absolutely precious. A memory to cherish and thanks for sharing this - it''s beautiful.</td>', 'Absolutely precious. A memory to cherish and thanks for sharing this - it''s beautiful.', '2007-06-07 01:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750070, 524959, 19708, '<td valign="top">Unusual. Looks like a 200 year old drawing.</td>', 'Unusual. Looks like a 200 year old drawing.', '2007-06-07 01:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750071, 511098, 19708, '<td valign="top">Cool point of view. Going to have to try this - I always shoot them from the side.</td>', 'Cool point of view. Going to have to try this - I always shoot them from the side.', '2007-06-07 01:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750073, 524996, 19708, '<td valign="top">I think the trees are taking far too much attention here, and didn''t notice until a bit later, the people down below.</td>', 'I think the trees are taking far too much attention here, and didn''t notice until a bit later, the people down below.', '2007-06-07 01:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750075, 520038, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great portrait and the B&amp;W conversion was a wise move.</td>', 'Great portrait and the B&W conversion was a wise move.', '2007-06-07 01:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750082, 525043, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great portrait and composition. The B&amp;W conversion/toning was a wise move.</td>', 'Great portrait and composition. The B&W conversion/toning was a wise move.', '2007-06-07 01:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750083, 525368, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great portrait and your B&amp;W conversion was nicely done.</td>', 'Great portrait and your B&W conversion was nicely done.', '2007-06-07 01:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750088, 524844, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great portrait and your B&amp;W conversion was nicely done. Shame about the black bras strap though.</td>', 'Great portrait and your B&W conversion was nicely done. Shame about the black bras strap though.', '2007-06-07 01:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750092, 522692, 19708, '<td valign="top">Superb! My first favorite of this challenge.</td>', 'Superb! My first favorite of this challenge.', '2007-06-07 01:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750101, 524785, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and your B&amp;W conversion was nicely done. The post-processing and/or noise reduction left the skin far to plastic-looking in my opinion. Please don''t take offense to this next comment, but it was my very first reaction when I saw it. I thought I was seeing Micheal Jackson  for a micro-second - skeery huh?</td>', 'Great lighting and your B&W conversion was nicely done. The post-processing and/or noise reduction left the skin far to plastic-looking in my opinion. Please don''t take offense to this next comment, but it was my very first reaction when I saw it. I thought I was seeing Micheal Jackson  for a micro-second - skeery huh?', '2007-06-07 01:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750106, 513100, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great portrait and your B&amp;W conversion was very nicely done.</td>', 'Great portrait and your B&W conversion was very nicely done.', '2007-06-07 01:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750112, 525332, 19708, '<td valign="top">Now how precious is this!!! Beautiful shot and applaud the lighting on this.</td>', 'Now how precious is this!!! Beautiful shot and applaud the lighting on this.', '2007-06-07 01:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750114, 524748, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great portrait and your B&amp;W conversion was nicely done.</td>', 'Great portrait and your B&W conversion was nicely done.', '2007-06-07 01:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750117, 513664, 19708, '<td valign="top">Classic pose and very nicely shot!</td>', 'Classic pose and very nicely shot!', '2007-06-07 01:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
