(3750128, 525241, 19708, '<td valign="top">I really like the facial expression captured here. Between the direction of her eyes and the hint of a smile, a different and more genuine expression is showing.</td>', 'I really like the facial expression captured here. Between the direction of her eyes and the hint of a smile, a different and more genuine expression is showing.', '2007-06-07 01:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750129, 524379, 19708, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait and your B&amp;W conversion was nicely done.</td>', 'Beautiful portrait and your B&W conversion was nicely done.', '2007-06-07 01:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750131, 509406, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great portrait and your B&amp;W conversion was nicely done.</td>', 'Great portrait and your B&W conversion was nicely done.', '2007-06-07 01:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750140, 525111, 70369, '<td valign="top">kinda hard to top the first one..</td>', 'kinda hard to top the first one..', '2007-06-07 01:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750147, 524844, 70369, '<td valign="top">hmmmmmmmm... This girl gets around...Unless it''s her twin, but I swear I just voted on the same model 7 images ago.. kinda makes me wonder if the same person is submitting images under two different names.. I''ll pass on my vote on this one to be fair..</td>', 'hmmmmmmmm... This girl gets around...Unless it''s her twin, but I swear I just voted on the same model 7 images ago.. kinda makes me wonder if the same person is submitting images under two different names.. I''ll pass on my vote on this one to be fair..', '2007-06-07 01:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750151, 522511, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great portrait and your B&amp;W conversion was nicely done. Shame about the bras straps. I know it''s the norm, but still looks odd.</td>', 'Great portrait and your B&W conversion was nicely done. Shame about the bras straps. I know it''s the norm, but still looks odd.', '2007-06-07 01:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750153, 517896, 39531, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred a crop that took out the habitat stuff I think it would have made the shot much more natural looking</td>', 'I would have preferred a crop that took out the habitat stuff I think it would have made the shot much more natural looking', '2007-06-07 01:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750156, 522630, 39531, '<td valign="top">I like the lines and composition. I think the shot would have had much more pop if the lighting had been less flat. When I have flat light like this I often switch to B&amp;W because the color saturation really isn''t there.</td>', 'I like the lines and composition. I think the shot would have had much more pop if the lighting had been less flat. When I have flat light like this I often switch to B&W because the color saturation really isn''t there.', '2007-06-07 01:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750157, 525259, 39531, '<td valign="top">nice minimalistic shot well composed</td>', 'nice minimalistic shot well composed', '2007-06-07 01:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750159, 525039, 19708, '<td valign="top">OK, you''ve got my attention. I''m looking and looking, see the shadow on the building and no support showing in the shadows, the shadow on the ground says no trampoline or similar. So, did he simply jump and pose like that? Guess I''ll wait - Love the shot btw :)</td>', 'OK, you''ve got my attention. I''m looking and looking, see the shadow on the building and no support showing in the shadows, the shadow on the ground says no trampoline or similar. So, did he simply jump and pose like that? Guess I''ll wait - Love the shot btw :)', '2007-06-07 01:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750162, 522361, 39531, '<td valign="top">I am not sure having this subject in the center helps this shot out. Good lighting and detail though</td>', 'I am not sure having this subject in the center helps this shot out. Good lighting and detail though', '2007-06-07 01:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750163, 524859, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great portrait, beautiful eyes and your B&amp;W conversion was nicely done.</td>', 'Great portrait, beautiful eyes and your B&W conversion was nicely done.', '2007-06-07 01:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750165, 517097, 39531, '<td valign="top">Nice try and I like the overall composition but, the light is not complimentary to your shot. A polarizer might help if it is not mid day but, earlier or later would have made the colors pop alot more although you would have had to cut the butterfly in on a modeling contract if you waited that long.</td>', 'Nice try and I like the overall composition but, the light is not complimentary to your shot. A polarizer might help if it is not mid day but, earlier or later would have made the colors pop alot more although you would have had to cut the butterfly in on a modeling contract if you waited that long.', '2007-06-07 01:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750167, 525217, 70369, '<td valign="top">lol.. did you seriously take a nest &amp; put it in an ice cream dish for a photo-op..</td>', 'lol.. did you seriously take a nest & put it in an ice cream dish for a photo-op..', '2007-06-07 01:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750168, 525375, 19708, '<td valign="top">Superb portrait and your B&amp;W conversion was very nicely done.<br/>No vote obviously from me, but between us, it''s a 10+</td>', 'Superb portrait and your B&W conversion was very nicely done.No vote obviously from me, but between us, it''s a 10+', '2007-06-07 01:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750173, 524014, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great portrait and your B&amp;W conversion was nicely done.</td>', 'Great portrait and your B&W conversion was nicely done.', '2007-06-07 01:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750174, 524844, 39880, '<td valign="top">She looks familiar.  So I''ll say it again, This is a nice portrait.  Nice and sharp.  Plus I really like the B&amp;W.</td>', 'She looks familiar.  So I''ll say it again, This is a nice portrait.  Nice and sharp.  Plus I really like the B&W.', '2007-06-07 01:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750175, 513134, 19708, '<td valign="top">Oh how magical is this!<br/>Just a bit more in the post-processing dept, to up the contrast a bit and a little local sharpening would be my direction on it.</td>', 'Oh how magical is this!Just a bit more in the post-processing dept, to up the contrast a bit and a little local sharpening would be my direction on it.', '2007-06-07 01:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750180, 521998, 19708, '<td valign="top">Well if this isn''t a goodman portrait, then you have mastered the art.<br/>Congrats! This s very nice.</td>', 'Well if this isn''t a goodman portrait, then you have mastered the art.Congrats! This s very nice.', '2007-06-07 01:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750183, 524999, 19708, '<td valign="top">Wow - beautiful tones and detail in the moon!</td>', 'Wow - beautiful tones and detail in the moon!', '2007-06-07 01:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750191, 507268, 19708, '<td valign="top">This had a lot of potential, but was hurt by the post-processing, particularly the noise reduction/neat image or similar.</td>', 'This had a lot of potential, but was hurt by the post-processing, particularly the noise reduction/neat image or similar.', '2007-06-07 01:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750196, 522724, 19708, '<td valign="top">Quite the view!<br/>A suggestion - we "think" we need to sharpen, sharpen, sharpen, when in fact sometimes it''s quite the opposite. Applying a soft filter on this and dropping the exposure a touch would have made this much easier on the eyes, less compression during the save and though softer, would have looked more natural.</td>', 'Quite the view!A suggestion - we "think" we need to sharpen, sharpen, sharpen, when in fact sometimes it''s quite the opposite. Applying a soft filter on this and dropping the exposure a touch would have made this much easier on the eyes, less compression during the save and though softer, would have looked more natural.', '2007-06-07 01:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750197, 519002, 19708, '<td valign="top">A classic type shot. Your B&amp;W conversion was nicely done.</td>', 'A classic type shot. Your B&W conversion was nicely done.', '2007-06-07 01:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750203, 524364, 19708, '<td valign="top">Clever title with the Postcards on the building. Nice B&amp;W.</td>', 'Clever title with the Postcards on the building. Nice B&W.', '2007-06-07 02:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750204, 522630, 19708, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and well seen!</td>', 'Nicely composed and well seen!', '2007-06-07 02:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750206, 524762, 19708, '<td valign="top">Very nice levels &amp; tones. The detail is quite good on this.</td>', 'Very nice levels & tones. The detail is quite good on this.', '2007-06-07 02:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750211, 506437, 19708, '<td valign="top">A classic pose and really hope this was taken as a candid. The post-processing went a bit too far in my opinion, leaving the skin on her face too artificially smooth and lacking in texture.</td>', 'A classic pose and really hope this was taken as a candid. The post-processing went a bit too far in my opinion, leaving the skin on her face too artificially smooth and lacking in texture.', '2007-06-07 02:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750212, 525075, 19708, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and levels on this. Nicely composed as well.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and levels on this. Nicely composed as well.', '2007-06-07 02:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3750218, 508210, 19708, '<td valign="top">Weird Al! Cool - thanks for sharing. This had to be a blast!</td>', 'Weird Al! Cool - thanks for sharing. This had to be a blast!', '2007-06-07 02:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
