(3752081, 520712, 67152, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition but the thing I like most is the processing - what a great choice to go with yellow sky - very dramatic - back for a comment and a bump to 9</td>', 'I really like the composition but the thing I like most is the processing - what a great choice to go with yellow sky - very dramatic - back for a comment and a bump to 9', '2007-06-07 15:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
