(3752084, 515978, 67152, '<td valign="top">I think the choice to invert the image is a little gimmicky - but it is really well shot and composed - so I will just look at the image by standing on my head...9</td>', 'I think the choice to invert the image is a little gimmicky - but it is really well shot and composed - so I will just look at the image by standing on my head...9', '2007-06-07 15:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
