(3752099, 524844, 67152, '<td valign="top">i love the glow created by the lighting - it really makes her skin look so soft yet there is such nice detail and sharpness to the jewelry and eyes etc - great image</td>', 'i love the glow created by the lighting - it really makes her skin look so soft yet there is such nice detail and sharpness to the jewelry and eyes etc - great image', '2007-06-07 15:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
