(3754507, 524272, 61818, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Unusual and interesting subject.  Can''t tell what it is on the left that is obstructing the view (coat over a chair maybe?) but it isn''t distinct enough on its own to be interesting and is placed in a way that it sort of throws off the balance of the shot.  Otherwise, really nice work.</td>', 'Very nice.  Unusual and interesting subject.  Can''t tell what it is on the left that is obstructing the view (coat over a chair maybe?) but it isn''t distinct enough on its own to be interesting and is placed in a way that it sort of throws off the balance of the shot.  Otherwise, really nice work.', '2007-06-07 22:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
