(3754631, 523919, 56895, '<td valign="top">Very good picture showing incredible emotion.  The only thing I would say is that the colour of the main subject blends too much into the background. Another strength of this photo is the placement of the main subject, which way over to the side, still commands all the focus.  Beautifully done.</td>', 'Very good picture showing incredible emotion.  The only thing I would say is that the colour of the main subject blends too much into the background. Another strength of this photo is the placement of the main subject, which way over to the side, still commands all the focus.  Beautifully done.', '2007-06-07 23:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
