(3754649, 523673, 59458, '<td valign="top">I think there are some simple things that you could have done to improve this photos. <br/> <br/>the first thing that caught my eye is that it is crooked. It needs to be rotated maybe 2 or 3 degrees counter clockwise.<br/> <br/>I also thing the crop is to tight. More space around the building might be nice. maybe a little less sky and a little more walk way. I alway try to shoot a subject a few different ways if I can.<br/> <br/>Another thing I see is noise. I see allot of noise in the sky. Double check your ISO setting. And most photo editing software programs have a noise remove tool.</td>', 'I think there are some simple things that you could have done to improve this photos.  the first thing that caught my eye is that it is crooked. It needs to be rotated maybe 2 or 3 degrees counter clockwise. I also thing the crop is to tight. More space around the building might be nice. maybe a little less sky and a little more walk way. I alway try to shoot a subject a few different ways if I can. Another thing I see is noise. I see allot of noise in the sky. Double check your ISO setting. And most photo editing software programs have a noise remove tool.', '2007-06-07 23:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3754651, 519727, 56895, '<td valign="top">Beautiful reflection on the close-up with beautiful contrast of colours.  The haze of the far off mountain that seems to be hovering above the water adds to the dreamlike sense.  I love it!</td>', 'Beautiful reflection on the close-up with beautiful contrast of colours.  The haze of the far off mountain that seems to be hovering above the water adds to the dreamlike sense.  I love it!', '2007-06-07 23:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
