(3754972, 510922, 50695, '<td valign="top">it''s so eerie how her identity has been obliterated. those lines seem to be running her out of existence. the strong perspective lines run into the same obliteration, like a doom toward which we are all heading. A really remarkable and bold photo. part of me says method doesn''t matter but another part of me wants this to have been some in-camera effect. both parts want to know how you did it. 10<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'it''s so eerie how her identity has been obliterated. those lines seem to be running her out of existence. the strong perspective lines run into the same obliteration, like a doom toward which we are all heading. A really remarkable and bold photo. part of me says method doesn''t matter but another part of me wants this to have been some in-camera effect. both parts want to know how you did it. 10 ', '2007-06-07 23:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
