(3755198, 511316, 811, '<td valign="top">nice colors and composition.  I think one thing that really works in this picture is that the grass, the sky, and the structure are the only things in it, yet they give the impression of being much more complex.</td>', 'nice colors and composition.  I think one thing that really works in this picture is that the grass, the sky, and the structure are the only things in it, yet they give the impression of being much more complex.', '2007-06-08 00:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3755200, 523349, 50695, '<td valign="top">well, you''re not quite ready to steal <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=50641" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">skewsme</a>''s crown, but this is still a nice example of the Surreal Cow Photo. 8</td>', 'well, you''re not quite ready to steal  skewsme''s crown, but this is still a nice example of the Surreal Cow Photo. 8', '2007-06-08 00:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
