(3755206, 519264, 811, '<td valign="top">good composition and clarity.  seems a little flat or dull (not subject-wise); maybe a bit of contrast adjustment, or if you could shoot at a different time of day to give it a bit more drama with shadows, or something</td>', 'good composition and clarity.  seems a little flat or dull (not subject-wise); maybe a bit of contrast adjustment, or if you could shoot at a different time of day to give it a bit more drama with shadows, or something', '2007-06-08 00:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3755212, 524363, 19708, '<td valign="top">This has a wonderful retro feel to it.<br/>I''m thinking this was a genuine candid moment caught due to the other people visible in the background, making this even more of an outstanding shot.<br/>One of the first of the small details that caught my eye was his hand gesture - gotta'' love that one!</td>', 'This has a wonderful retro feel to it.I''m thinking this was a genuine candid moment caught due to the other people visible in the background, making this even more of an outstanding shot.One of the first of the small details that caught my eye was his hand gesture - gotta'' love that one!', '2007-06-08 00:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3755213, 522047, 811, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  This is one of those shots that would be neat to do from the same angle (or as close as possible) during each of the four seasons.</td>', 'Very pretty.  This is one of those shots that would be neat to do from the same angle (or as close as possible) during each of the four seasons.', '2007-06-08 00:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3755220, 525356, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice sky.  The windmills all but get lost, though.  It took me just me just a second to see them.</td>', 'Nice sky.  The windmills all but get lost, though.  It took me just me just a second to see them.', '2007-06-08 00:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3755228, 514839, 48717, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Like father, like son!</td>', 'LOL!  Like father, like son!', '2007-06-08 00:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3755231, 524592, 811, '<td valign="top">good use of shallow dof</td>', 'good use of shallow dof', '2007-06-08 00:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3755232, 524863, 19708, '<td valign="top">Hate to be cruel, but this needs some serious help in the post-processing, as the overall tones are far too yellow. In regards to the composition, there are two main focal points - the wave crashing and the upright  pole on the left side. A tighter crop so the pier/jetty starts out of the frame would probably have been better so there isn''t competition for where my eyes are drawn. The other issue is the noise levels in the sky - affects the overall quality a lot.<br/>If you need help in post-processing or links to tips, tutorials and help, please don''t hesitate to PM me during or after the challenge.<br/>I have not voted on this image, but would be in the 3-4 range.</td>', 'Hate to be cruel, but this needs some serious help in the post-processing, as the overall tones are far too yellow. In regards to the composition, there are two main focal points - the wave crashing and the upright  pole on the left side. A tighter crop so the pier/jetty starts out of the frame would probably have been better so there isn''t competition for where my eyes are drawn. The other issue is the noise levels in the sky - affects the overall quality a lot.If you need help in post-processing or links to tips, tutorials and help, please don''t hesitate to PM me during or after the challenge.I have not voted on this image, but would be in the 3-4 range.', '2007-06-08 00:28:17.000000', NULL, 1);
