(3755652, 524574, 69325, '<td valign="top">i think this photo finished WAY to low...i loved it...i can''t believe some people want to complain about the horizon or crop on the foot..to me that adds to the action feel of the shot...sometimes i think they should change the name of this site to dpcriticize!</td>', 'i think this photo finished WAY to low...i loved it...i can''t believe some people want to complain about the horizon or crop on the foot..to me that adds to the action feel of the shot...sometimes i think they should change the name of this site to dpcriticize!', '2007-06-08 01:48:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(3755653, 524618, 51793, '<td valign="top">WOW, Neil really didn''t even know this was yours until just now. I thought it would do so much better than it did. I loved the bright colors and great contrast. Totally stoked man, Sorry, BUT... Come check me out way up there at 165th</td>', 'WOW, Neil really didn''t even know this was yours until just now. I thought it would do so much better than it did. I loved the bright colors and great contrast. Totally stoked man, Sorry, BUT... Come check me out way up there at 165th', '2007-06-08 01:48:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(3755661, 520067, 17148, '<td valign="top">Screw everyone who though it was too dark and would be better in color...it''s beautiful and should have done much better. Don''t change a thing.</td>', 'Screw everyone who though it was too dark and would be better in color...it''s beautiful and should have done much better. Don''t change a thing.', '2007-06-08 01:50:55.000000', NULL, 0),
