(3755688, 513280, 67841, '<td valign="top">I never even got through voting half the images in this Free Study &amp; didn''t see yours, Dave!  This was a moment nicely captured - storytelling compositions are my fav...</td>', 'I never even got through voting half the images in this Free Study & didn''t see yours, Dave!  This was a moment nicely captured - storytelling compositions are my fav...', '2007-06-08 01:56:35.000000', NULL, 0),
