(3755713, 522882, 66384, '<td valign="top">Catherine, you are really on a roll these days. This is gorgeous, and well appreciated by the voters. It seems a bit risky, having all those horizontal lines cutting all the way across the image, but I think the mast and rigging connecting the foreground with the sky/background definitely helps with that problem.<br/> <br/>Another observation -- you provoked a lot of thoughtful comments -- not just the usual: "nice", "love it", "cool" type comments that are so prevalent.</td>', 'Catherine, you are really on a roll these days. This is gorgeous, and well appreciated by the voters. It seems a bit risky, having all those horizontal lines cutting all the way across the image, but I think the mast and rigging connecting the foreground with the sky/background definitely helps with that problem. Another observation -- you provoked a lot of thoughtful comments -- not just the usual: "nice", "love it", "cool" type comments that are so prevalent.', '2007-06-08 02:04:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(3755719, 520208, 41337, '<td valign="top">Congrats Mark!</td>', 'Congrats Mark!', '2007-06-08 02:06:11.000000', NULL, 0),
