(3755752, 507983, 47541, '<td valign="top">Live lizards at the museum?  crazy!  I guess we''ll have to go there one winters weekend and see.  Great shot and good editing given the hue changes you needed to do.</td>', 'Live lizards at the museum?  crazy!  I guess we''ll have to go there one winters weekend and see.  Great shot and good editing given the hue changes you needed to do.', '2007-06-08 02:18:25.000000', NULL, 0),
