(3756101, 525022, 3746, '<td valign="top">Yeeeeeeeeeaaaaaaaaah.<br/> <br/>Told you it would be your first ribbon Jeff!!  But to get the blue is just showing off. Its LONG overdue in my opinion.<br/> <br/>Incredibly, its not your usual style of shot.<br/> <br/>Amazing shot, I though I had a great Tiger shot this month, but seeing this blew me away.<br/> <br/>Anyway, I wont go on, coming first in what is probably the biggest Monthly freestudy ever is testament to both this shot, and your talent.. nice one.<br/> <br/>(EDIT) who the hell voted this a 2 or 4?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-06-08 03:47:00.</i></td>', 'Yeeeeeeeeeaaaaaaaaah. Told you it would be your first ribbon Jeff!!  But to get the blue is just showing off. Its LONG overdue in my opinion. Incredibly, its not your usual style of shot. Amazing shot, I though I had a great Tiger shot this month, but seeing this blew me away. Anyway, I wont go on, coming first in what is probably the biggest Monthly freestudy ever is testament to both this shot, and your talent.. nice one. (EDIT) who the hell voted this a 2 or 4?', '2007-06-08 04:45:01.000000', '2007-06-08 04:47:00.000000', 0),
(3756102, 521077, 27133, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by robinssong:</b></div><hr/><i> We see a lot of photos of this beach, but this one has some special qualities like the splash of the waves on the rocks, the nice POV from the water-washed shore and the line of the clouds drawing you in to the sun then the line of the sun back to the rock in the foreground. Very peaceful. It takes me there. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I don''t think this is the beach you think it is!!!!!</td>', 'Originally posted by robinssong: We see a lot of photos of this beach, but this one has some special qualities like the splash of the waves on the rocks, the nice POV from the water-washed shore and the line of the clouds drawing you in to the sun then the line of the sun back to the rock in the foreground. Very peaceful. It takes me there.   I don''t think this is the beach you think it is!!!!!', '2007-06-08 04:45:13.000000', NULL, 0),
