(3756118, 523232, 19708, '<td valign="top">Just because I offered during the challenge.<br/> <br/>In Photoshop CS2, I took the image above, and did the following:<br/>Open<br/>Image, Adjustments, Match color, clicked Neutralize, slid the color intensity left to 80.<br/>Image, adjustments, Shadow/Highlight, Shadows to 20, Highlights to 10.<br/>Image, Adjustments, Levels, Click Options, Shadows box at 0.5, Highlights box at 0.5 <i>(my defaults)</i>, Click OK.<br/>Done.<br/> <br/>Real simple adjustments can have a huge effect:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=523232" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/679/thumb/523232.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/679/thumb/523232.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/679/thumb/523232.jpg"/></a> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=530320" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/19708/thumb/530320.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/19708/thumb/530320.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/19708/thumb/530320.jpg"/></a> <br/>------- Before ---------- &amp; ----------- After -----------<br/> <br/><i>(open each in a new window &amp; switch between them in the task bar to see changes)</i><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-06-08 04:17:33.</i></td>', 'Just because I offered during the challenge. In Photoshop CS2, I took the image above, and did the following:OpenImage, Adjustments, Match color, clicked Neutralize, slid the color intensity left to 80.Image, adjustments, Shadow/Highlight, Shadows to 20, Highlights to 10.Image, Adjustments, Levels, Click Options, Shadows box at 0.5, Highlights box at 0.5 (my defaults), Click OK.Done. Real simple adjustments can have a huge effect:   ------- Before ---------- & ----------- After ----------- (open each in a new window & switch between them in the task bar to see changes)', '2007-06-08 05:15:30.000000', '2007-06-08 05:17:33.000000', 0),
