(3756253, 524073, 23394, '<td valign="top">take your pick ;-)<br/> <br/>"i''m sorry, i thought 1 was for first place"<br/>"i''m sorry, but my car shot is getting hammered so i''m hammering back"<br/>"i''m sorry, but i vote with random clicks and you got caught on the low end"<br/>"i''m sorry, i can''t explain it, but that image just sucks, imho"<br/>"i''m sorry, but that''s my ex''s car"<br/>"i''m sorry, but i had to get married because of the how much room there is in the back of that car"<br/>"i''m sorry, but that gray cloud just really takes away from the aesthetics"<br/>"i''m sorry, but monday was just a bad day for me to be voting"<br/>"i''m sorry, but i start everyone at a 1 and there were too many for me to get back to bump you"<br/>"i''m sorry, but i was hoping for a picture of a tiger and then this came up"<br/>"i''m sorry, but i prefer film"</td>', 'take your pick ;-) "i''m sorry, i thought 1 was for first place""i''m sorry, but my car shot is getting hammered so i''m hammering back""i''m sorry, but i vote with random clicks and you got caught on the low end""i''m sorry, i can''t explain it, but that image just sucks, imho""i''m sorry, but that''s my ex''s car""i''m sorry, but i had to get married because of the how much room there is in the back of that car""i''m sorry, but that gray cloud just really takes away from the aesthetics""i''m sorry, but monday was just a bad day for me to be voting""i''m sorry, but i start everyone at a 1 and there were too many for me to get back to bump you""i''m sorry, but i was hoping for a picture of a tiger and then this came up""i''m sorry, but i prefer film"', '2007-06-08 06:53:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(3756260, 520829, 22551, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments.   Clearly from the comments it appears that what I thought was interesting did not go over too well.  The woman in the front is too hot and that was unintended.  I did, however, intentionally put the woman in the back in the heavy shadow.  I just thought that would be an interesting contrast between the two.  I have a tendency to enter pics that are somewhat unconventional and perhaps my instincts are a bit off.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments.   Clearly from the comments it appears that what I thought was interesting did not go over too well.  The woman in the front is too hot and that was unintended.  I did, however, intentionally put the woman in the back in the heavy shadow.  I just thought that would be an interesting contrast between the two.  I have a tendency to enter pics that are somewhat unconventional and perhaps my instincts are a bit off.', '2007-06-08 06:56:45.000000', NULL, 0),
