(3756335, 522692, 51538, '<td valign="top">All that much nicer because the shoes make this image from no particular time.  It could as easily be the 30s as the 2000s.  It has hints of a story too.</td>', 'All that much nicer because the shoes make this image from no particular time.  It could as easily be the 30s as the 2000s.  It has hints of a story too.', '2007-06-08 07:43:50.000000', NULL, 0),
