(3756339, 520829, 37961, '<td valign="top">None of the lighting issues bother me here with this photo. I am accepting it for what it is. The lady in the shadow seems perfectly lit and with her face being dark it gives it a sense of mystery. One questions her obscurity which makes the photo a little more interesting in my opinion. While technically flawed, the portrait has an element of interest to it. So yes, you succeeded. <br/> <br/></td>', 'None of the lighting issues bother me here with this photo. I am accepting it for what it is. The lady in the shadow seems perfectly lit and with her face being dark it gives it a sense of mystery. One questions her obscurity which makes the photo a little more interesting in my opinion. While technically flawed, the portrait has an element of interest to it. So yes, you succeeded.  ', '2007-06-08 07:45:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(3756344, 510550, 56417, '<td valign="top">great shot!.....wonderful processing gives it a surreal feel....</td>', 'great shot!.....wonderful processing gives it a surreal feel....', '2007-06-08 07:46:42.000000', NULL, 0),
