(3756800, 517617, 15204, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 9.  I think the post-processing really worked great on it.  I know that images processed like this often do not do well, but I was really surprised to see how low this was voted.  I loved it.  Great composition, great sharpness, great color in the eyes, great details even with the high-key processing.  The bang-on eye contact really makes it. Liza</td>', 'I gave this a 9.  I think the post-processing really worked great on it.  I know that images processed like this often do not do well, but I was really surprised to see how low this was voted.  I loved it.  Great composition, great sharpness, great color in the eyes, great details even with the high-key processing.  The bang-on eye contact really makes it. Liza', '2007-06-08 10:38:53.000000', NULL, 0),
