(3757116, 524272, 41047, '<td valign="top">congratulations on your well deserved ribbon. awesome.</td>', 'congratulations on your well deserved ribbon. awesome.', '2007-06-08 12:13:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(3757120, 525156, 66384, '<td valign="top">Marvelous shot. Such life! I really like the light and colors. The background is a little distracting to me. The far shore cuts straight across the image. I don''t know what to suggest except to crop it just below the shoreline and make it a landscape orientation.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-06-08 11:16:51.</i></td>', 'Marvelous shot. Such life! I really like the light and colors. The background is a little distracting to me. The far shore cuts straight across the image. I don''t know what to suggest except to crop it just below the shoreline and make it a landscape orientation.', '2007-06-08 12:15:41.000000', '2007-06-08 12:16:51.000000', 0),
(3757122, 525217, 74605, '<td valign="top">Amazing work.  The detail and colors are incredible.  I agree with others here that is should have scored much higher.  Everything about it is great!</td>', 'Amazing work.  The detail and colors are incredible.  I agree with others here that is should have scored much higher.  Everything about it is great!', '2007-06-08 12:16:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(3757130, 521448, 52500, '<td valign="top">This is a really beautiful photo.  I didn''t end up voting on the free study, but I did glance through them.  This one really caught my eye.  Looking back through the entries again, I love it even more.  Going in the favs!</td>', 'This is a really beautiful photo.  I didn''t end up voting on the free study, but I did glance through them.  This one really caught my eye.  Looking back through the entries again, I love it even more.  Going in the favs!', '2007-06-08 12:20:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(3757137, 507855, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very, very subtle...and you know how that goes for scoring.  It''s a great photo...peaceful &amp; calming.  FWIW I think most of the "constructive criticisms" offered are off-base.  Anyways...nicely done!<br/> <br/>...oh, and I love how you made Lakewood/Applewood disappear!</td>', 'Very, very subtle...and you know how that goes for scoring.  It''s a great photo...peaceful & calming.  FWIW I think most of the "constructive criticisms" offered are off-base.  Anyways...nicely done! ...oh, and I love how you made Lakewood/Applewood disappear!', '2007-06-08 12:23:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(3757145, 523591, 21915, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the nice comments :)</td>', 'Thanks for all the nice comments :)', '2007-06-08 12:24:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(3757168, 507268, 66384, '<td valign="top">I think this was a good capture, and you achieved your goal of bring out the adult aspect of the girl.<br/> <br/>I don''t care for the processing. The hair looks glued together rather than soft and wispy as I imagine it really was. The contrast on the lips is very harsh (little detail of the mouth is visible) and the edges seem over sharpened. I also don''t see any detail in the iris of her eyes. Maybe this is due to excessive noise reduction.<br/> <br/>I''d like to see the original. I''ll bet there are all sorts of good things you could do with it.</td>', 'I think this was a good capture, and you achieved your goal of bring out the adult aspect of the girl. I don''t care for the processing. The hair looks glued together rather than soft and wispy as I imagine it really was. The contrast on the lips is very harsh (little detail of the mouth is visible) and the edges seem over sharpened. I also don''t see any detail in the iris of her eyes. Maybe this is due to excessive noise reduction. I''d like to see the original. I''ll bet there are all sorts of good things you could do with it.', '2007-06-08 12:33:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(3757171, 524073, 21915, '<td valign="top">There is no way this should get a vote of 1. Very good work, watch out for them trolls Brad</td>', 'There is no way this should get a vote of 1. Very good work, watch out for them trolls Brad', '2007-06-08 12:33:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(3757180, 525022, 7969, '<td valign="top">one of these kind of shots was also in the national geographic newsletter as one of the pictures of the week.<br/> <br/>I tried to find it in my mail, but could not....sorry<br/> <br/>edit to add link found<br/>&lt;//news.nationalgeographic.com/news/2007/06/photogalleries/wip-week31/photo3.html&gt;<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-06-08 11:40:14.</i></td>', 'one of these kind of shots was also in the national geographic newsletter as one of the pictures of the week. I tried to find it in my mail, but could not....sorry edit to add link found<//news.nationalgeographic.com/news/2007/06/photogalleries/wip-week31/photo3.html>', '2007-06-08 12:38:11.000000', '2007-06-08 12:40:14.000000', 0),
