(3757191, 525415, 66384, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait, Dave. Is this the same girl as the one with the rose? She is so pretty and lighting and pose are so flattering. I think this deserved a much higher score, but all the commenters seem to agree that the focus on the eyes isn''t quite sharp enough. It''s amazing what a difference tack sharp eyes make.</td>', 'Lovely portrait, Dave. Is this the same girl as the one with the rose? She is so pretty and lighting and pose are so flattering. I think this deserved a much higher score, but all the commenters seem to agree that the focus on the eyes isn''t quite sharp enough. It''s amazing what a difference tack sharp eyes make.', '2007-06-08 12:41:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(3757203, 524676, 20330, '<td valign="top">good job... not a bad placing in a FS :)</td>', 'good job... not a bad placing in a FS :)', '2007-06-08 12:48:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(3757209, 511316, 30982, '<td valign="top">Yowza - kick butt and take some names!  Very nice finish on a great shot!</td>', 'Yowza - kick butt and take some names!  Very nice finish on a great shot!', '2007-06-08 12:50:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(3757217, 523821, 30982, '<td valign="top">I suspected Pekesty or you for this one - very lovely perspective and processing on this beauty.</td>', 'I suspected Pekesty or you for this one - very lovely perspective and processing on this beauty.', '2007-06-08 12:52:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(3757218, 521055, 42013, '<td valign="top">Super work. Congrats!</td>', 'Super work. Congrats!', '2007-06-08 12:53:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(3757221, 525403, 30982, '<td valign="top">Kind of has a "where no bug has gone before" feel to it.  Wonderful macro-ish pic with excellent color, great bokeh.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Kind of has a "where no bug has gone before" feel to it.  Wonderful macro-ish pic with excellent color, great bokeh.  Nicely done!', '2007-06-08 12:54:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(3757234, 525281, 42100, '<td valign="top">Your entry looks OOF, simply PP for that alone would have improved your score.  Your PP version does look very nice, but I think for a greater improvement in score you might want to look at your composition.  It''s very difficult to get a centered photo that just looks right.  When it doesn''t look right people notice, they can''t always put their finger on why, but they notice.  I think your photo is really begging for an off-centered composition.  <br/> <br/>Don''t fall into the trap that you have to use rules and guidelines, but just remember there is a reason they exist.<br/> <br/>eta..<br/> <br/>I just saw the comment about her looking uncomfortable, that''s a good point...for evidence look at her knees.  Probably got all red like that trying to get into position.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-06-08 12:16:22.</i></td>', 'Your entry looks OOF, simply PP for that alone would have improved your score.  Your PP version does look very nice, but I think for a greater improvement in score you might want to look at your composition.  It''s very difficult to get a centered photo that just looks right.  When it doesn''t look right people notice, they can''t always put their finger on why, but they notice.  I think your photo is really begging for an off-centered composition.   Don''t fall into the trap that you have to use rules and guidelines, but just remember there is a reason they exist. eta.. I just saw the comment about her looking uncomfortable, that''s a good point...for evidence look at her knees.  Probably got all red like that trying to get into position.', '2007-06-08 13:00:18.000000', '2007-06-08 13:16:22.000000', 0),
(3757237, 525022, 17990, '<td valign="top">Wow! congrats on your ribbon, this is an amazing image (the others are also great) I love it!</td>', 'Wow! congrats on your ribbon, this is an amazing image (the others are also great) I love it!', '2007-06-08 13:01:36.000000', NULL, 0),
