(3757435, 522882, 50641, '<td valign="top">Goodness, have you lapsed <i>again</i>?  I liked alot this during voting.  I''m grateful that you didn''t remove the natural color cast of the sunset from the white of the boat. It glows with a realistic beauty and I can imagine actually being there.</td>', 'Goodness, have you lapsed again?  I liked alot this during voting.  I''m grateful that you didn''t remove the natural color cast of the sunset from the white of the boat. It glows with a realistic beauty and I can imagine actually being there.', '2007-06-08 14:21:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(3757453, 524785, 3032, '<td valign="top">If you have put so much energy into this one I am really curious now what the next big thing will be that you were talking about. :)<br/> <br/>What we discussed about backgrounds would also be nice to implement in this style of shot. Make a big portfolio map, go to some cool bars and restaurants in Paris and arrange an on location shoot or something. You have the charm to convince them. :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'If you have put so much energy into this one I am really curious now what the next big thing will be that you were talking about. :) What we discussed about backgrounds would also be nice to implement in this style of shot. Make a big portfolio map, go to some cool bars and restaurants in Paris and arrange an on location shoot or something. You have the charm to convince them. :) ', '2007-06-08 14:25:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(3757475, 516172, 57421, '<td valign="top">really great photo. love the technical qualities as well as the emotion.</td>', 'really great photo. love the technical qualities as well as the emotion.', '2007-06-08 14:32:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(3757478, 525022, 16230, '<td valign="top">Excellent! Congratulations on a great set of shots and a well deserved blue ribbon.</td>', 'Excellent! Congratulations on a great set of shots and a well deserved blue ribbon.', '2007-06-08 14:32:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(3757494, 525415, 71951, '<td valign="top">One of my friends is really into portraits so I''ve been playing with hers. What I''ve found that works good(so far) is on a background copy layer using the magic selection tool for just the skin, applying Gaussian Blur (~4-7 pixels) and then decreasing the opactiy to about 30-50% (your preference on how much). Then I magic selection tool the eyes and increase the brightness and contrast to about 6-10. You may know this already, just thought I''d throw that out there. Personally, I think it''s a great portrait with great lighting/great subject.</td>', 'One of my friends is really into portraits so I''ve been playing with hers. What I''ve found that works good(so far) is on a background copy layer using the magic selection tool for just the skin, applying Gaussian Blur (~4-7 pixels) and then decreasing the opactiy to about 30-50% (your preference on how much). Then I magic selection tool the eyes and increase the brightness and contrast to about 6-10. You may know this already, just thought I''d throw that out there. Personally, I think it''s a great portrait with great lighting/great subject.', '2007-06-08 14:39:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(3757495, 525022, 57378, '<td valign="top">WOOO HOOO - Validation is back - All is OK!<br/>Thanks again for all the wonderful comments guys - Means a lot!<br/>There is a print option available for this too....<br/>Cheers<br/>Jeff</td>', 'WOOO HOOO - Validation is back - All is OK!Thanks again for all the wonderful comments guys - Means a lot!There is a print option available for this too....CheersJeff', '2007-06-08 14:40:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(3757535, 523821, 35804, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by pekesty:</b></div><hr/><i> Ha...I wish I could get tones that good, or composition that good, or...<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Melethia:</b></div><hr/><i> I suspected Pekesty or you for this one - very lovely perspective and processing on this beauty. </i></td></tr></table> </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Deb you are awesome...and so are you Mark...yep...you guys rule.</td>', 'Originally posted by pekesty: Ha...I wish I could get tones that good, or composition that good, or... Originally posted by Melethia: I suspected Pekesty or you for this one - very lovely perspective and processing on this beauty.    Deb you are awesome...and so are you Mark...yep...you guys rule.', '2007-06-08 14:55:51.000000', NULL, 0),
