(3761045, 520281, 78716, '<td valign="top">I think your shot is awesome as is the editing and I agree it is a shot every photographer must take.<br/>I just wanted to point out that you are allowed to sell pics of the London Eye unless you have written permission from BA themselves. By selling a print here DPChallenge could face legal action as well as yourselves.<br/>But I''m sure you''ve taken all the ness precautions :D</td>', 'I think your shot is awesome as is the editing and I agree it is a shot every photographer must take.I just wanted to point out that you are allowed to sell pics of the London Eye unless you have written permission from BA themselves. By selling a print here DPChallenge could face legal action as well as yourselves.But I''m sure you''ve taken all the ness precautions :D', '2007-06-09 19:21:31.000000', NULL, 0),
