(3761195, 525365, 68504, '<td valign="top">Holds some kind of power...  You have great sense of line/geometry, and now it is balanced by the gravitas of your subject.  (I wonder if that balance would be a little more dynamic if you cropped a bit off the right - you''d lose some of your friend''s shadow, and make the corner centered which you may not want).</td>', 'Holds some kind of power...  You have great sense of line/geometry, and now it is balanced by the gravitas of your subject.  (I wonder if that balance would be a little more dynamic if you cropped a bit off the right - you''d lose some of your friend''s shadow, and make the corner centered which you may not want).', '2007-06-09 20:13:30.000000', NULL, 0),
