(3766519, 524363, 27133, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Judi:</b></div><hr/><i> Great capture....more tonal control would make this one a winner. 7 </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Sorry if you found this to be a negative comment but I only told it how I saw it.</td>', 'Originally posted by Judi: Great capture....more tonal control would make this one a winner. 7   Sorry if you found this to be a negative comment but I only told it how I saw it.', '2007-06-11 06:19:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(3766529, 524014, 27133, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Judi:</b></div><hr/><i> A little too flat...needs some contrast. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Even though you weren''t too keen on my comment I did give you a 6...so I didn''t drop your score!!</td>', 'Originally posted by Judi: A little too flat...needs some contrast.   Even though you weren''t too keen on my comment I did give you a 6...so I didn''t drop your score!!', '2007-06-11 06:21:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(3766538, 520859, 27133, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Judi:</b></div><hr/><i> Nicely done. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Maybe I did drop your score...I gave you a 6...but at least I had the nerve to comment.  The majority of the other people who scored you less than me...didn''t!!!</td>', 'Originally posted by Judi: Nicely done.   Maybe I did drop your score...I gave you a 6...but at least I had the nerve to comment.  The majority of the other people who scored you less than me...didn''t!!!', '2007-06-11 06:23:21.000000', NULL, 0),
