(3767554, 524272, 48560, '<td valign="top">bummer... not really sure what happened here with the disqualification description, but i''m assuming it was something overlooked on your part. that said, this is still a powerful image and deserved being mentioned and appreciated. i hope you arent discouraged and will continue sharing with us your view of the world through your camera!</td>', 'bummer... not really sure what happened here with the disqualification description, but i''m assuming it was something overlooked on your part. that said, this is still a powerful image and deserved being mentioned and appreciated. i hope you arent discouraged and will continue sharing with us your view of the world through your camera!', '2007-06-11 11:07:13.000000', NULL, 0),
