(3767629, 524272, 44877, '<td valign="top">So sorry for the DQ. Regardless, you created a beautiful image that shines way beyond DPC rules. Thanks for sharing it with us.</td>', 'So sorry for the DQ. Regardless, you created a beautiful image that shines way beyond DPC rules. Thanks for sharing it with us.', '2007-06-11 11:28:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(3767673, 523436, 59415, '<td valign="top">haha, ya it is just blurry from my crappy kit lens.  I know the effect you are talking about though.  It is sort of a weird haze or something across it.  I hope to one day have some better gear.  The print looks great however!  Sharp and clear.  I am blowing it up huge next time.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-06-11 16:29:28.</i></td>', 'haha, ya it is just blurry from my crappy kit lens.  I know the effect you are talking about though.  It is sort of a weird haze or something across it.  I hope to one day have some better gear.  The print looks great however!  Sharp and clear.  I am blowing it up huge next time.', '2007-06-11 11:40:50.000000', '2007-06-11 17:29:28.000000', 0),
(3767703, 525022, 77970, '<td valign="top">Just saw a shot very similar to these in Sports Illustrated this week. Is it yours?</td>', 'Just saw a shot very similar to these in Sports Illustrated this week. Is it yours?', '2007-06-11 11:47:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(3767723, 521998, 41746, '<td valign="top">Powerful portrait. You know, if people take decent photos of black kids, they always get comments that it is Lesley Goodman behind the camera. That is of course one of the best compliments anyone can hope for!<br/> <br/>Congrats on your 4ht place!</td>', 'Powerful portrait. You know, if people take decent photos of black kids, they always get comments that it is Lesley Goodman behind the camera. That is of course one of the best compliments anyone can hope for! Congrats on your 4ht place!', '2007-06-11 11:54:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(3767729, 524272, 36371, '<td valign="top">This is EXACTLY why I did NOT renew my membership at DPC.<br/>Not because of editing or if a pixel is out of place, but there are just too many Anal Annies running around here for me.<br/>This photo is a beautlful moment captured and from the comments left, it struck a chord in most folks too.<br/>Lighten UP around this place and you''ll get more members.<br/>I have made this one of my favorites despite what the SC deems as a ''''failure''''.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-06-11 10:58:30.</i></td>', 'This is EXACTLY why I did NOT renew my membership at DPC.Not because of editing or if a pixel is out of place, but there are just too many Anal Annies running around here for me.This photo is a beautlful moment captured and from the comments left, it struck a chord in most folks too.Lighten UP around this place and you''ll get more members.I have made this one of my favorites despite what the SC deems as a ''''failure''''.', '2007-06-11 11:56:43.000000', '2007-06-11 11:58:30.000000', 0),
(3767739, 524272, 41047, '<td valign="top">i''m sorry for the dq. this is such a lovely moment being captured.</td>', 'i''m sorry for the dq. this is such a lovely moment being captured.', '2007-06-11 12:00:43.000000', NULL, 0),
