(3767781, 524272, 60495, '<td valign="top">Still a great image, really powerful. <br/> <br/>Sometimes the rules are somewhat up for interpretation so it would be interesting to see what was changed so we all know what not to do.</td>', 'Still a great image, really powerful.  Sometimes the rules are somewhat up for interpretation so it would be interesting to see what was changed so we all know what not to do.', '2007-06-11 12:15:02.000000', NULL, 0),
