(3770909, 524272, 36065, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Bosborne:</b></div><hr/><i> This is EXACTLY why I did NOT renew my membership at DPC.<br/>Not because of editing or if a pixel is out of place, but there are just too many Anal Annies running around here for me.<br/>This photo is a beautlful moment captured and from the comments left, it struck a chord in most folks too.<br/>Lighten UP around this place and you''ll get more members.<br/>I have made this one of my favorites despite what the SC deems as a ''''failure''''. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Bosborne, I''d like to personally thank you for NOT renewing your membership.  If you can''t find it in your ethics to submit within site rules, you shouldn''t be here.  While this is a great shot, many more shots could be just as great with significant editing that is outside the rule sets that you agree to when you submit an image.  Accept the rules or don''t post.  That''s pretty easy.</td>', 'Originally posted by Bosborne: This is EXACTLY why I did NOT renew my membership at DPC.Not because of editing or if a pixel is out of place, but there are just too many Anal Annies running around here for me.This photo is a beautlful moment captured and from the comments left, it struck a chord in most folks too.Lighten UP around this place and you''ll get more members.I have made this one of my favorites despite what the SC deems as a ''''failure''''.   Bosborne, I''d like to personally thank you for NOT renewing your membership.  If you can''t find it in your ethics to submit within site rules, you shouldn''t be here.  While this is a great shot, many more shots could be just as great with significant editing that is outside the rule sets that you agree to when you submit an image.  Accept the rules or don''t post.  That''s pretty easy.', '2007-06-11 23:53:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(3770936, 522361, 41337, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your new PB. Nice work on the editing.</td>', 'Congrats on your new PB. Nice work on the editing.', '2007-06-11 23:58:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(3771186, 525156, 40106, '<td valign="top">This is a really fantastic shot!  So much life in her eyes and smile!  I love the DOF on it too, it gives the water a really nice look.  Overall colors in this are really great!!!  Really great work!<br/>-Shannon</td>', 'This is a really fantastic shot!  So much life in her eyes and smile!  I love the DOF on it too, it gives the water a really nice look.  Overall colors in this are really great!!!  Really great work!-Shannon', '2007-06-12 00:34:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(3771196, 515978, 40106, '<td valign="top">whoooa! how crazy!!  love the creativity on this!  What a cool place to shoot at, I would be alll over those reflections!  Great work!<br/>-Shannon</td>', 'whoooa! how crazy!!  love the creativity on this!  What a cool place to shoot at, I would be alll over those reflections!  Great work!-Shannon', '2007-06-12 00:35:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(3771202, 513280, 40106, '<td valign="top">Really fantastic! This grabbed my eye from the thumbnail!  I love how there are no other people or no sign of life besides them in this shot.  Its just them and the city!  I love the way they are touching too, it adds such a sweetness to this shot.  Wonderful work!<br/>-Shannon</td>', 'Really fantastic! This grabbed my eye from the thumbnail!  I love how there are no other people or no sign of life besides them in this shot.  Its just them and the city!  I love the way they are touching too, it adds such a sweetness to this shot.  Wonderful work!-Shannon', '2007-06-12 00:37:47.000000', NULL, 0),
