(3775466, 525295, 32997, '<td valign="top">I have to say..let this be a lesson to you..shooting from the hip is not worthwhile, because when you look up you find art...and yes I mean that, this is not something the hip knows, this is something the eye sees, that busy brain of yours captures..<br/>I am immensely disappointed that you didn''t achieve one of your profile goals with this shot..being mistaken for me..:)<br/>and now I can''t say it is good, or I would sound like an idiot...ok it is more like <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=35669" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">boysetsfire</a>...<br/>I like it!</td>', 'I have to say..let this be a lesson to you..shooting from the hip is not worthwhile, because when you look up you find art...and yes I mean that, this is not something the hip knows, this is something the eye sees, that busy brain of yours captures..I am immensely disappointed that you didn''t achieve one of your profile goals with this shot..being mistaken for me..:)and now I can''t say it is good, or I would sound like an idiot...ok it is more like  boysetsfire...I like it!', '2007-06-12 23:52:36.000000', NULL, 0),
