(3777953, 512139, 3569, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments!<br/> <br/>The storm passed and dumped a good bit of rain and some hail.  I wish I had a wide angle lens.  The whole sky was mammatus clouds under the anvil of the large cumulonimbus (thunderstorm) cloud. It was so large it made cropping a challenge. <br/> <br/>Van</td>', 'Thanks for the comments! The storm passed and dumped a good bit of rain and some hail.  I wish I had a wide angle lens.  The whole sky was mammatus clouds under the anvil of the large cumulonimbus (thunderstorm) cloud. It was so large it made cropping a challenge.  Van', '2007-06-13 10:29:04.000000', NULL, 0),
