(3780640, 525022, 56658, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Roots:</b></div><hr/><i> //forums.digitalpoint.com/showthread.php?t=352655 <br/>Either you have another profile, or he took your pics, or you took his pics??<br/>also this exact photo is found here: //www.news.com.au/adelaidenow/gallery/0,22613,5023347-5006374-12,00.html </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>well for one Jeff is a news photographer and is credited for the shots in several newspapers not to mention was validated here so he had the original file, so I would say it is safe to bet he didn''t steal them. It does appear that the linked shot was taken from him though.</td>', 'Originally posted by Roots: //forums.digitalpoint.com/showthread.php?t=352655 Either you have another profile, or he took your pics, or you took his pics??also this exact photo is found here: //www.news.com.au/adelaidenow/gallery/0,22613,5023347-5006374-12,00.html   well for one Jeff is a news photographer and is credited for the shots in several newspapers not to mention was validated here so he had the original file, so I would say it is safe to bet he didn''t steal them. It does appear that the linked shot was taken from him though.', '2007-06-13 23:29:20.000000', NULL, 0),
