(3787422, 524853, 28710, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool shot of the bird. Needs some work on the rest of it IMHO.<br/> <br/>have you given any thought to adding a layer of NI to smooth out the OOF BG areas?<br/> <br/>I took the liberty of mucking about a little. What do you think?<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=536143" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/28710/thumb/536143.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/28710/thumb/536143.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/28710/thumb/536143.jpg"/></a> <br/>Details on the pic.<br/> <br/>PS, do you use a laser trigger? You seem to have quite a portfolio of things in flight.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-06-15 07:38:01.</i></td>', 'Pretty cool shot of the bird. Needs some work on the rest of it IMHO. have you given any thought to adding a layer of NI to smooth out the OOF BG areas? I took the liberty of mucking about a little. What do you think?  Details on the pic. PS, do you use a laser trigger? You seem to have quite a portfolio of things in flight.', '2007-06-15 08:00:51.000000', '2007-06-15 08:38:01.000000', 0),
