(3800402, 525213, 60862, '<td valign="top">Rob, I think this composition is really strong and your focus is dead on.  Her pose is sexy but also strong, and the background is nicely blurred.  Frankly, I''m surprised at the score.<br/> <br/>I think the lighting hurt you, esp. the blown areas along her back.  Were they blown in the original?<br/> <br/>Have you learned how to adjust light using soft light layers?  Check out <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=55" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Idnic''s tutorial</a> and give this another shot. I think you could darken the background and lighten her face and really improve things.</td>', 'Rob, I think this composition is really strong and your focus is dead on.  Her pose is sexy but also strong, and the background is nicely blurred.  Frankly, I''m surprised at the score. I think the lighting hurt you, esp. the blown areas along her back.  Were they blown in the original? Have you learned how to adjust light using soft light layers?  Check out Idnic''s tutorial and give this another shot. I think you could darken the background and lighten her face and really improve things.', '2007-06-19 01:40:41.000000', NULL, 0),
