(3804625, 515152, 41409, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a moment you caught here.  I gave this shot a 6 because it isn''t as sharp as it could be.  I would try to stop down the lens a bit to increase the sharpness and apply some more post processing unsharp mask or smart sharpen to it.  Great job and great capture.</td>', 'Wow, what a moment you caught here.  I gave this shot a 6 because it isn''t as sharp as it could be.  I would try to stop down the lens a bit to increase the sharpness and apply some more post processing unsharp mask or smart sharpen to it.  Great job and great capture.', '2007-06-20 00:58:33.000000', NULL, 0),
