(3816907, 525412, 67145, '<td valign="top">i''m making my second comment on this which is straight after the last one i made, as i go thru your portfolio trying to decide on the five i''m going to choose as my favs of yours for our harajuku girls inspirational task ..<br/>i love sooooooo many things about this awesome image ... the amount of images i see in dpc is astronomical, but a few remain in my head and are easily remembered .. this is one of them .. <br/>i particularly love the rich, deep and intense colour contrasts going on .. the fantastic dark background with those brooding clouds, seeming to hover ominously over those containers .. i didnt realise at first that the squiggly bits are actually seagulls ... thats another awesome touch ... gotta thank those seagulls!! .. the light shining on the rhs with its perfect shape .. excellent composition .. all the elements in this image work so well ... the story of these containers has been told to perfection !! .. :):)xx</td>', 'i''m making my second comment on this which is straight after the last one i made, as i go thru your portfolio trying to decide on the five i''m going to choose as my favs of yours for our harajuku girls inspirational task ..i love sooooooo many things about this awesome image ... the amount of images i see in dpc is astronomical, but a few remain in my head and are easily remembered .. this is one of them .. i particularly love the rich, deep and intense colour contrasts going on .. the fantastic dark background with those brooding clouds, seeming to hover ominously over those containers .. i didnt realise at first that the squiggly bits are actually seagulls ... thats another awesome touch ... gotta thank those seagulls!! .. the light shining on the rhs with its perfect shape .. excellent composition .. all the elements in this image work so well ... the story of these containers has been told to perfection !! .. :):)xx', '2007-06-21 18:33:12.000000', NULL, 0),
