(3828556, 524556, 68956, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by DrAchoo:</b></div><hr/><i> Was this lit with a ring flash or other flash unit? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>No, I''d like to own one, I find lighting for macro very difficult. This was done with ambient light, predominantly backlit although it was an overcast day. This was balanced with a silver reflector from this side of the camera. :)  Do you use ring flash with your macros?</td>', 'Originally posted by DrAchoo: Was this lit with a ring flash or other flash unit?  No, I''d like to own one, I find lighting for macro very difficult. This was done with ambient light, predominantly backlit although it was an overcast day. This was balanced with a silver reflector from this side of the camera. :)  Do you use ring flash with your macros?', '2007-06-24 18:18:38.000000', NULL, 0),
