(3830701, 525412, 34938, '<td valign="top">Hey Lisa,<br/> <br/>I love the seagulls! I travel to and from work on the Bolte every day and sometimes at night it just amazes me how many seaglls there are! I also love the ITALIA thing...of course!<br/> <br/>I didn''t get to vote on all the images in this challenge, so it was good to see this now. <br/> <br/>Enzo</td>', 'Hey Lisa, I love the seagulls! I travel to and from work on the Bolte every day and sometimes at night it just amazes me how many seaglls there are! I also love the ITALIA thing...of course! I didn''t get to vote on all the images in this challenge, so it was good to see this now.  Enzo', '2007-06-25 06:14:35.000000', NULL, 0),
