(3977816, 524649, 73601, '<td valign="top">We''ve all seen this bridge photographed, but I like what you have done with the lighting, has an nice moody, eerie look and feel to it, good job</td>', 'We''ve all seen this bridge photographed, but I like what you have done with the lighting, has an nice moody, eerie look and feel to it, good job', '2007-08-07 18:28:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(3979431, 524463, 25678, '<td valign="top">ah, unfortunately, another tragic scene lost among those who are unfamiliar with ballet. I can see the tragic loss in her eyes - this most have been a fabulous piece to photograph (as I know from your other photographs). You''ve done a wonderful job with your camera, but I wonder if having f/2.8 won''t help you get more wonderful pictures from ballets</td>', 'ah, unfortunately, another tragic scene lost among those who are unfamiliar with ballet. I can see the tragic loss in her eyes - this most have been a fabulous piece to photograph (as I know from your other photographs). You''ve done a wonderful job with your camera, but I wonder if having f/2.8 won''t help you get more wonderful pictures from ballets', '2007-08-08 02:13:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(3983786, 513397, 44877, '<td valign="top">This jumped out at me for obvious reasons. I think it''s inspired, superb and very arty - especially for a nature shot, which makes it even more interesting and outstanding. It has a slight abstract feel to it and the colors are magnificent. <br/> <br/>I read the comments and had to laugh - just because they are so DPC-esque. Too blurry? The insect is muted? And the colors are oversaturated? Puleeze - I hope you took none of that to heart.</td>', 'This jumped out at me for obvious reasons. I think it''s inspired, superb and very arty - especially for a nature shot, which makes it even more interesting and outstanding. It has a slight abstract feel to it and the colors are magnificent.  I read the comments and had to laugh - just because they are so DPC-esque. Too blurry? The insect is muted? And the colors are oversaturated? Puleeze - I hope you took none of that to heart.', '2007-08-09 11:51:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4008418, 524053, 18450, '<td valign="top">Very, very beautiful shot!</td>', 'Very, very beautiful shot!', '2007-08-18 01:54:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4009817, 520208, 35044, '<td valign="top">Surely you know that to ribbon you need an underwater shot of a tiger.  Fantastic image though if one is not too fussy about seeing only half the tiger submerged.  <br/> <br/></td>', 'Surely you know that to ribbon you need an underwater shot of a tiger.  Fantastic image though if one is not too fussy about seeing only half the tiger submerged.   ', '2007-08-18 20:31:01.000000', NULL, 0);
