(4209534, 510363, 39218, '<td valign="top">Hello!<br/> <br/>   My first impression of this was how much I wish I had had a photograph like this of myself with any one of my three children.  I love the way mommy''s fingers are framing the baby''s face so tenderly, while still allowing you to fully see her precious little ear.  The little milk lips, even the little baby finger bent the way it is.  You wouldn''t want to change a hair on her head. This print is perfection.  I love it!  She''s just a little Georgia peach!</td>', 'Hello!    My first impression of this was how much I wish I had had a photograph like this of myself with any one of my three children.  I love the way mommy''s fingers are framing the baby''s face so tenderly, while still allowing you to fully see her precious little ear.  The little milk lips, even the little baby finger bent the way it is.  You wouldn''t want to change a hair on her head. This print is perfection.  I love it!  She''s just a little Georgia peach!', '2007-10-31 19:26:16.000000', NULL, 0),
